UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`=' Good, good. One step closer to eliminating those beady-eyed, basket-wearing, hog-nosed, two-toed... ...hunchbacked, squealing, prickly... no-good... gnome-loving... GREEEAAAAGH!  Quilboar!' WHERE `word_id` = 176671; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25190
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`=' Good. Can\'t say I\'ll miss the company, if you can call it that. You\'d think at least in the middle of the swamp you\'d get some privacy, you know?' WHERE `word_id` = 184151; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27340
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`=' Good. Now just do as Forward Commander Onslaught commands. Try your best to fit in with the rest of the soldiers. We don\'t want the Gilneas Liberation Front to get suspicious. Oh, you  didn\'t know they were watching us? Right now there are five different worgen spies looking down on our position. Just be calm and follow orders. I\'ll let you know when we are ready to proceed.' WHERE `word_id` = 184160; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27342
