UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Bloodsail Buccaneers attacking Booty Bay?  This isn\'t the first time that those blaggards have tried something. Booty Bay is impenetrable! Sounds like they might be changing their strategies up, though. Wouldn\'t put it past Firallon to try something crazy. Very well, let\'s see what else they\'re up to.' WHERE `word_id` = 181702; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=26611
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Bloodsail Buccaneers attacking Booty Bay? They might as well throw themselves off the Overlook Cliffs. Nonetheless, by bringing me this information you have done my fleet of swashbucklers a great service. The Blackwater Raiders thank you.' WHERE `word_id` = 132716; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=599
