UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Chief Squealer Thornmantle leads these quilboar. It was he that set upon Greatmother Hawkwind and took her life, leading the attack on Camp Narache. He fled and hid afterwards, but we\'ve found him. He lurks to the west within his foul den of thorns, fending off any braves we send in after him.$B$BYou\'ve proven yourself as a brave defender of our people, $N. Kill Thornmantle and bring his mane back to Chief Hawkwind, in honor of our Greatmother!' WHERE `word_id` = 174417; -- locales_quest - details : entry=14460
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Chieftain Cliffwalker and his tauren seek to commit treason against the Horde! They claim that the ancient tree at the heart of Battlescar Valley is merely a school for druids. They are blind to the fact that desperate measures are taken during war time. My scouts have assured me that the night elves hide a weapon of great power within that tree. We\'re going to end this now!' WHERE `word_id` = 179810; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=26077
