UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Delays, delays, delays! I\'m at wit\'s end!$B$BI was told that this goblin was brilliant - that he\'d come up with gadgets sure to shock the enemy into submission. So far he\'s produced nothing but empty promises. If he comes up empty-handed again, I\'m going to toss him off the cliff!$B$BYou go and speak to him, $C. Let him know that my fuse is running short!' WHERE `word_id` = 172845; -- locales_quest - details : entry=13936
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Delber\'s technicians have been up day and night helping us prepare for this strike. Aside from building and tuning the personnel launcher, his men have prepared the covert operations air wing for a strike on Frostmane Retreat. They\'ll be waiting for a signal to begin their strikes.$B$BTake this flare with you, and set it off near the cluster of buildings at the northern end of the village, and the buildings at the southern end of the village. The flying machines will make a quick strike at each site.' WHERE `word_id` = 178912; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25841
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Deliana had you contact me? I\'ll do my best to help you, but first I must ask a great favor of you.' WHERE `word_id` = 144593; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=8929
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Delicious!$B$BAzy always trying to get his hands on magic artifacts. Said he was trying to make friends with that archmage person. Xylem!$B$BXylem has LOTS of apprentices. Takes in all kinds, burns\'m out, leaves them wandering all over. High turnover.$B$BLast one was last night. Headed over towards that big goblin tower construction thing, way west. Maybe he\'ll help you meet Xylem? Maybe Xylem knows where Azy is?$B$BPlay nice!' WHERE `word_id` = 174055; -- locales_quest - details : entry=14345
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Delightful! This will do splendidly...$B$BHere, good $N, take this as payment for your honorable deed.' WHERE `word_id` = 130799; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=157
