UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Och!$B$BYou an\' junior took yer sweet time gettin\'  \'ere, din\'t ya!?$B$B$GDrinkin\' ale:Holdin\' hands;, takin\' in the sights, I\'ll wager.$B$BDon\'t go breakin\' yer arm pattin\' yerself on the back now, the real work\'s just beginnin\'!$B$BThere be more ta this ancient artifact than ye know, but in order ta reveal its secrets, we need ta get it to the Cradle of the Ancients!$B$BNow howdya spose we do that?$B$BMaybe junior over there has some bright ideas, eh?' WHERE `word_id` = 188814; -- locales_quest - details : entry=28621
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Odd that the sands in that thing are still falling upward. I think I will have it delivered to its new owner with all due haste.$B$BI thank you for a job well done, $C. You have certainly earned your commission.$B$BCome back tomorrow and I will have another request for you to fulfill.' WHERE `word_id` = 154261; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=11382
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Odd, these eyes are not exactly what I am used to working with. The way that the arakkoa use their magic is slightly different than our own.$B$BIt looks like we\'re going to need one more thing if I\'m going to be able to scry for the information to locate Dugar.' WHERE `word_id` = 149067; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=9950
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Odd. The samples from the vicious teromoths are infused with what feels to me to be pure mana.$B$BIt would seem that whatever caused all of this death also left behind that strong field of residual energy. But for some reason the teromoths were not killed by it; instead being driven into an agitated state.$B$BIt seems apparent that this strange energy is the by-product of whatever attacked the thicket.' WHERE `word_id` = 149126; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=9968
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Odd... It looks as if someone used gemstones as lenses. I should be able to fix them without too much trouble.' WHERE `word_id` = 184888; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27541
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Of all of our tasks here in Hyjal, the most pressing is simple: destroy these invaders. The very nature of fire is that it is all-consuming. Lower your defense for just a moment and it will destroy everything in sight.$B$BKill any of the fiery invaders you find. Every enemy defeated purchases more time for Hyjal.' WHERE `word_id` = 189875; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29123
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Of all Ragnaros\' minions, the flamewakers appear to be the most devoted. Most of them dwell within this cave, preparing for another attack. Our foothold may be strong, but we will not tolerate any surprise attacks from these worms.$B$BNo, we will strike first.$B$BTear them apart, $N.' WHERE `word_id` = 190552; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29264
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Of all the buildings in all the towns to collapse, why\'d it have to be this one?!' WHERE `word_id` = 185229; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27644
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Of all the places to end up across Azeroth, I\'m stuck here in Grom\'gol. With the marauding wildlife, the caravan raids, and the constant threat of troll attacks, I\'m surprised I\'ve survived for this long.$B$BCould be worse, I suppose. At least here in Grom\'gol we have walls and guards. There\'s a group of hunters up north that set up camp right in the middle of the jungle!$B$BI see people heading there all the time. If you\'re looking for trouble, feel free to head up there. I\'ll stick with my Grom\'gol.' WHERE `word_id` = 180767; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26340
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Of all the...you found this in an ogre den? Unthinkable. I\'m amazed they didn\'t try to smash it to pieces. With any luck, $C, we\'ll be able to obtain even more fascinating antiquities here...if you\'re willing to help.' WHERE `word_id` = 176028; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25018
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Of course a young $R like you would have no trouble taking care of a few wild animals. With the roads clear, my journey to the next tower will be much easier.' WHERE `word_id` = 184317; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27382
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Of course I have a plan for moving the coffer. Someday, maybe the old coot will learn to trust me.' WHERE `word_id` = 188816; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28621
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Of course I recognize my own leaves. Look at that! It\'s in perfect condition.$B$BHow good of you to return it, $C.$B$BPerhaps you could be of service to us and we to you.' WHERE `word_id` = 142245; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=7632
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Of course I\'ll teach you how to make imperial plate armor! It might cost you a bit of gold... in the form of thorium bars!' WHERE `word_id` = 152793; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10891
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Of course it worked! I\'m a spymaster; my information is always accurate.$B$BAnyhow, I have a whole new exciting job lined up for you. You want to hear about it? Of course you do.' WHERE `word_id` = 150646; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10329
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Of course we haven\'t returned yet!  We\'ve had our fair share of setbacks... not the least of which was the passing of my dear brother Oskar. He lost his grip and floated away, the poor lad!  He thought he\'d grab some fish to bring back to the captain, but he floated off, and was eaten by one o\' those... those great-eels!  Bwaaaah ha ha haaaah!' WHERE `word_id` = 179592; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=26014
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Of course you can borrow Bastia. That is, if she\'ll take you.' WHERE `word_id` = 176335; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25099
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Of course you remember Lord Darius Crowley\'s daughter, Lorna.$B$BShe never quite recovered after losing her father in Gilneas City. She\'s basically led the life of a hermit. The only visitor she\'s allowed into her house has been Krennan... and he won\'t say a word about the whole thing.$B$BSend word to her about the evacuation.' WHERE `word_id` = 174276; -- locales_quest - details : entry=14406
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Of course! I had a hunch this is what we\'d find. Had no idea about the organic transformations, though, I must admit. There\'s more to this old relic than I\'d dared to hope.' WHERE `word_id` = 188865; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28633
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Of course! Lakota Windsong! Why didn\'t I think of this before?$B$BArnak kidnapped Lakota years ago and tried to force her into being his bride. She managed to escape, but in the chaos of the recent attack on Freewind Post, he took her again.$B$BShe has to be around here somewhere. She\'s become quite the mystic in recent years. I\'m guessing she\'ll know what to do with these tauren artifacts.' WHERE `word_id` = 184213; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27357
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Of course! We will use their own weapons against them!' WHERE `word_id` = 149293; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10010
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Of course, dear. Our little girl works at Sentinel Hill and is very close with the homeless of Westfall. Perhaps she has overheard something. Before you go, let me wrap up the Westfall Stew and tell you a little bit about our dear little girl.' WHERE `word_id` = 180495; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=26270
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Of course, we\'ll want to free as many slaves as we can while we\'re here. Most of them will likely join forces with us, anxious to fight against their captors.$B$BHowever, sometimes you will find that slaves are resistant to being freed. It\'s a strange phenomenon, often called "Durnholde Syndrome".$B$BEither way, you should try to free them. If they resist, treat them as enemies. Report your results to Evonice Sootsmoker, deeper within the Slag Pit.' WHERE `word_id` = 186736; -- locales_quest - details : entry=28055
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Of course, with our luck, I probably could\'ve predicted this. Well, we\'re not going to let him get away that easily. Let\'s see what that note says.' WHERE `word_id` = 161701; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=12895
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Of course. I will see to it that the sacred waters are transported through the portal right away.$B$BThank you, $C.' WHERE `word_id` = 190608; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=29279
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Off to a good start, $N!' WHERE `word_id` = 130946; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=193
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Offer Jasper\'s Jungle Cooler to Gmurgl, Orgus, and Captain Bartholomew Softbeard.' WHERE `word_id` = 181391; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=26534
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Offer the Blessed Rice Cakes at the Shrine of the Ancestors in Darnassus.' WHERE `word_id` = 337733; -- locales_quest - completedText : entry=29314
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Offering placed' WHERE `word_id` = 175222; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=24679
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Offering to Azshara prevented' WHERE `word_id` = 172757; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=13900
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Officer Jankie wants you to ride her mount to Nijel\'s Point and speak to Corporal Melkins.' WHERE `word_id` = 174177; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=14384
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oftentimes the best way to ensure our men sustain as few injuries as possible is to cause great harm to our enemies in their very homes and prevent battles from ever occurring!$B$BTravel to the Scarlet Monastery and speak with Dark Ranger Velonara in their graveyard. She is leading a Forsaken assault there and could benefit from a seasoned $C such as yourself.' WHERE `word_id` = 183040; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26986
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Ogres Fed' WHERE `word_id` = 175823; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=24963
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Ogron? Yeah, that me. Shh. Keep voice down. Crocs hear you.' WHERE `word_id` = 184049; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27306
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh - marvelous. Tell me more. And that precocious young Gadgetspring? Dead as well? Ah, wonderful. My work here is important but at times I do miss the carnage of demolishing my enemies on a more personal level. Here, perhaps you can make use of some of my discarded equipment.' WHERE `word_id` = 174174; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=14383
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh aye ... we get a few of these kegs out to the boys on the front and we\'re gonna see some fireworks. Thank you, $N!' WHERE `word_id` = 185630; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27752
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh aye, quite a haul! This\'ll last me until... oh say probably tomorrow.' WHERE `word_id` = 189446; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28861
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh aye, tha\'s the stuff! A good engineer can make anything outta just about anything. This here doo-jicker could recouple a busted cylinder casing... Oh! And who doesn\'t want a dongle? ...And you can fashion this jobby into a ... thing. Yep, perfect.' WHERE `word_id` = 184434; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27433
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh boy, here we go again.' WHERE `word_id` = 142182; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=7601
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh boy. Mogor has invoked his right of battle as hero of the Warmaul. You have to fight him!$B$BNobody ever said the Warmaul were good sports... erm... ogres.' WHERE `word_id` = 335202; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=9973
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh brother, it\'s a mess down there! I barely made it out last time - which is what prompted my request to the High Commander.$B$B<Durkon looks you up and down.>$B$BYou got that crazy look in your eyes, $R. Thankfully, you\'re gonna need to be crazy to do what I\'m about to ask of you.' WHERE `word_id` = 159470; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=12309
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh dear! Are you sure Incendius said \'Ragnaros?\'$B$B<Jalinda hands you something and pats you on the wrist as she fades deep into thought.>' WHERE `word_id` = 138940; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=4263
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh dear, Raz has been captured! As soon as we entered a dozen cultists and some big fat ogre jumped us. I ran while I Raz tried to fight them off. We need to save him, $N!' WHERE `word_id` = 189127; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28732
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh dear, these are quite large!! I can\'t imagine finding a gnome that would fit snuggly into them, but not to worry - if the gnome we find is not big enough, I can make adjustments to his costume.$B$BMany thanks, $N. Here are the tickets I promised you.' WHERE `word_id` = 142609; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=7883
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh dear. It seems the forces at work here are a bit difficult to control...$B$BPlease, don\'t bother Naralex with this. It will only upset him.' WHERE `word_id` = 174956; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=24566
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh dear; I was wondering why I hadn\'t seen Iverron yet today. And I\'ve always warned him about those spiders...' WHERE `word_id` = 138232; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=3519
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh excellent, excellent. That\'ll help a little, for the present...$B$B<He trails off, grumbling about profit margins and costs...>$B$BWhat? You\'re still here? Reward? Oh, right... of course, here, take this... it should be more than enough.' WHERE `word_id` = 130941; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=189
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh fer the love of...$B$BI know our survivor friend here means well, but the lad\'s been severely traumatized.$B$BThere only be one way ta deal with these accursed beasts, an\' that be a fine dwarven axe buried hilt-deep in the noggin.$B$BPile up enough o\' their corpses an\' they\'ll think twice before fiddlin\' with yer tasty bits.$B$BMark me words $Gladdie:lassie;, them buggers don\'t like the sight o\' their own blood any more than you or I.$B$BNow git out there an\' give \'em what fer!' WHERE `word_id` = 179105; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25884
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh for the Love of the Light... they\'re dripping on the ground.$B$BCan\'t stand touching those things, myself. Fish are all well and good, but when they grow legs and start walking around... Haven\'t eaten a fish in weeks, let me tell you, and in Southshore, that means you aren\'t eating much.' WHERE `word_id` = 132538; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=559
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh for... not again! If you heard the deputy yelling out there, that means we\'ve got a fullblown oil leak on our hands! It\'s those filthy worgen again!$B$BListen, it\'s going to be total chaos out there. Sleep-deprived goblins running around screaming and not knowing what to do. I need you to snap the workers back to their senses.$B$BA good, swift backhand across the face should do it! Once they shake themselves off, they\'ll get to work capping those gushers!' WHERE `word_id` = 187859; -- locales_quest - details : entry=28336
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh good! For a moment I thought I was going to have to test the rats out on someone to make sure that they weren\'t defective.$B$BProgress, finally!' WHERE `word_id` = 335876; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=12211
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh good, a $C. Maybe you\'ll have better luck in dealing with these trolls.$B$BSee what they want and then try to get rid of them.' WHERE `word_id` = 190003; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=29156
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh good, another warm body!$B$BI hope that elf up there didn\'t bore you to death. We\'ve got a lot of bugs to kill here.' WHERE `word_id` = 188979; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28676
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh good, help, and just in time!' WHERE `word_id` = 155408; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=11199
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh good, it\'s undamaged! Thanks a lot.$B$BYou ah, you might want to wipe yourself off a bit there.' WHERE `word_id` = 178509; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25726
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh good, there you are! And just in time... there is much to be done!' WHERE `word_id` = 148247; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=9758
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh good, you brought another catapult with you! Clay might be older than dirt, but he makes a mean war machine.$B$BWell, you didn\'t bring it all the way out here for your health, flesh bag. Get in one of those things and bombard the fungal terrors and reinforcements streaming out of Needlerock Slag.$B$BWe have to keep them off the front!' WHERE `word_id` = 182234; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26755
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh good, you\'re back! Don\'t leave me alone with her! She\'s crazy! Gimme that, I\'ll have you seeing the invisible in no time!' WHERE `word_id` = 186713; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28049
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh good. You thinned out that pack quite a bit, and without those wolves nipping out our heels, we can bind our minds to dealing with Morbent Fel.$B$BHere, take some of these Flash Bundles. They make them in town, and a lot have been donated to Sven to help with his cause.' WHERE `word_id` = 131106; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=226
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh gosh! Someone\'s finally here to help us?' WHERE `word_id` = 186357; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27952
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh happy day!$B$BBy not using the time and resources of the apothecaries to get the job done, I\'m sure to attract the attention of the high executor!$B$BThinking outside the box, that\'s what I\'m all about. Yes, yes, you had a hand in helping too.$B$BHere, if I give you something will you promise to not mention your part in all of this?' WHERE `word_id` = 159108; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=12232
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh have I got a deal for you! Immerse yourself in foreign cultures, go on epic adventures, blow things up, and get paid to do it! Sound too good to be true? Well it\'s not - this is what we do!$B$BIf you\'re interested, head over to Gallywix Defense Post on Forlorn Ridge to the north and look for Commander Molotov.' WHERE `word_id` = 174447; -- locales_quest - details : entry=14468
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh hey, yer just in time! I was working up a huge appetite, workin\' so hard to feed these hungry refugees. Yessir.' WHERE `word_id` = 189449; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28862
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh ho! Have a drink with me, $N. You look tough on the outside, but let\'s see if your gut can handle a few mugs of the Pig and Whistle\'s strongest!!$B$BOr... were you here for a lesson?' WHERE `word_id` = 135995; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=1638
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh how happy these little woodland nymphs shall be! We\'ll make them feel right at home with this special concoction!' WHERE `word_id` = 134563; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=1058
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh I see, it\'s a Krazek\'s Crock Pot! An ingenious piece of work, but it can break a spring or throw a gear now and then. Let me see what\'s wrong with this one...$B$BAha! Its steam charger is rusted out, it has a cracked knuckle-gasket and its fobulator is missing teeth. I\'m surprised the pot could even boil a turnip in this state!$B$BCan I fix it? Of course I can fix it!$B$BBut there\'s a price. Oh yes, there is always a price...' WHERE `word_id` = 131036; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=210
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh joyous day! And look, just beyond the mountain to the northeast creeps a whole field of Scourge for us to obliterate!' WHERE `word_id` = 158889; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=12182
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh look, it\'s one of little Schnottz\'s pamphlets. I\'ll just be taking that from you, if you don\'t mind.' WHERE `word_id` = 187007; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28132
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh man, am I glad to see you! Did the chief send you down from the Hammer?' WHERE `word_id` = 163415; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=13293
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh man, that was awesome! You should\'ve seen the flames coming out of the hive! Here\'s your reward, for entertaining me as much as for clearing the hive!' WHERE `word_id` = 175772; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=24953
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh me achin\' feets.$B$BI figured since ye didn\'t have a luffa...' WHERE `word_id` = 142399; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=7727
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh my goodness, these are more than I\'d hoped for! You are certainly to be lauded for your heroics!$B$BThis looks like a fine brood of blackwhelps to make a start with. Examining them, that is.$B$BPlease, accept this as payment. I insist!' WHERE `word_id` = 152169; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10747
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh my goodness, you made it! I was uncertain.$B$BYou flickered in and out of the time stream there for a moment during the fight! I thought for sure that we\'d lost you!$B$BBut here you are safe and sound, with your past self rescued, on the other side of the time loop you were in.$B$BYou\'re quite the temporal hero, $N!' WHERE `word_id` = 163610; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=13343
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh my gosh! Pirates!$B$B$N, there are Southsea pirates crashing your party!$B$BYou have to get in there and do something about this or your career, and any chance of you being the next Trade $G Prince : Princess;, is going to be ruined!' WHERE `word_id` = 173303; -- locales_quest - details : entry=14115
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh my gosh, babe! Everyone is here! Who cares about some stupid dragon?$B$BWe setup the party around the pool. Sounds like they\'re having a great time. You are going to look so good!$B$BWhy don\'t you head over to the pool and keep everyone entertained? I\'ll join you in a moment... I just have to slip into something even more amazing!' WHERE `word_id` = 173297; -- locales_quest - details : entry=14113
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh my! Focusing the dome\'s energy seems to continue accelerating growth to the point where it breeds extreme aggression. If we do get the ability to use this technology, we have to be sure to calibrate it correctly.' WHERE `word_id` = 150998; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10426
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh my! Leave it to Prospector Remtravel to discover such a find!' WHERE `word_id` = 133317; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=741
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='oh my! thank you! we will send a couple scouts and warriors out there quickly to deal with those trolls, and rescue Ranger Lilatha, you are so kind to help!' WHERE `word_id` = 146480; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=9212
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh my! These notes are amazing! And what\'s more... they\'re incredible and they\'re stupendous and they make my knees go all a-wobbly!$B$BFuren had a breakthrough! A real breakthrough! I can\'t wait to try out his new technique!' WHERE `word_id` = 136171; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=1704
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh my! This book hasn\'t rested on these shelves since before the rebuilding of Stormwind, years ago. It will have to be restored of course, it\'s in bad shape, but I would be honored to place it within our rare books collection.$B$BThank you, $N. Please accept this as payment for returning the book!' WHERE `word_id` = 131568; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=337
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh my! This information explains quite a lot about Thaurissan.$B$BThere is much more to learn!' WHERE `word_id` = 138420; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=3701
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh my! This is a small scouting and hunting party? You must tell Mo\'mor what you have discovered.' WHERE `word_id` = 148935; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=9918
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh my! Who\'s your little friend? It followed you, you say?' WHERE `word_id` = 190525; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=29254
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh my! You say this came from the distant lands of Kalimdor?$B$BAmazing! Simply amazing!' WHERE `word_id` = 134117; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=942
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh my, the news is grave....' WHERE `word_id` = 132848; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=632
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh my, this looks to be a list of ship departures and arrivals, with accurate dates and times and everything!  If the captain of a pirate ship got his hands on this, he could have himself a field day!$B$BYou say you got this from a pirate?  Well that\'s disturbing news...$B$BThank you, $N. I\'m glad you took it from him, and I\'m glad that pirate\'s eating dirt right now!' WHERE `word_id` = 137368; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=2876
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh my. 250? This thing doesn\'t go past 250. How are you still standing? You should be a puddle of goo by now. Sylvanas will be most displeased with this information. There might be some things we can do to reduce the lethality levels of the area by a few decades, but that still leaves us out by about a hundred or so years.' WHERE `word_id` = 187809; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28324
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh my. It sounds like you ran across quite a sinister being. I wonder what one of those was doing all the way out here...' WHERE `word_id` = 185651; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27757
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh my. Their reactions were that different?$B$BNot completely what I was expecting, but I think I have a speech that will do.$B$BJust let me find where I put it...' WHERE `word_id` = 165441; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25283
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh my. We want to question this Quilboar, not tenderize him!' WHERE `word_id` = 172911; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=13961
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh my... the banshees are very tortured souls indeed. Merely holding their essence is emotionally painful... Enough of that for now. I\'ll get to work on counteracting their magic, then we\'ll have a portal up and running in no time. Stratholme will be ours soon, I just know it.' WHERE `word_id` = 184221; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27359
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh NO you\'re covered in SPIDER-SPORCH! You\'re such a brave $R. I hope you\'ll go into the Firelands soon and step on ALL the spiders.' WHERE `word_id` = 190028; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=29162
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh no!  That\'s horrible news!  I can\'t believe that all but two of our Cenarion friends are dead.$B$BAlright, let me have a look at those parts. I\'m just hoping they aren\'t what I suspect that they might be.' WHERE `word_id` = 149227; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=9995
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh no! My weapons and totems! They\'re destroyed!!!' WHERE `word_id` = 185528; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27720
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh no! That\'s horrible news! I can\'t believe that all but two of our Cenarion friends are dead.$B$BAlright, let me have a look at those parts. I\'m just hoping they aren\'t what I suspect that they might be.$B$BYes, as I feared, I believe these are bomb parts. Our eyes and ears in Shattrath City have been feeding us information about some of the ethereals importing proscribed goods from other dimensions that they\'re in contact with.' WHERE `word_id` = 149223; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=9994
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='OH NO! They plan to "test" the bomb at Thal\'darah Grove! That\'s the school for young druids located in the heart of Battlescar Valley. You\'ve got to return to Barus with this information! Master Thal\'darah must be warned!' WHERE `word_id` = 179072; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25876
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh no, $N, the cannonballs are hitting the Speedbarge. I\'d say the Southsea pirates are getting more accurate... the ship is on fire!$B$BYou\'ve got a river boat now. Please, go speak with Griznak.$B$BExtinguish those fires!' WHERE `word_id` = 177755; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25533
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh no... and we sent you down there to kill her, didn\'t we?$B$B<The commander shakes her head and sighs.>$B$BI\'m sorry. I\'ll see to it that the letter is delivered to her father, Archmage Malin in Stormwind, right away. Don\'t worry, you won\'t be implicated... it wasn\'t your fault.$B$BTry to put it out of your mind. There was no way that you could have known, $N.' WHERE `word_id` = 158378; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=12067
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh SWEET justice! Killin\' those kobolds won\'t make me walk like a normal person and it sure won\'t get me a job, but damn does it feel good. Here, I think I got somethin\' for you from my kobold huntin\' days. Maybe you can put it to good use.' WHERE `word_id` = 180335; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=26229
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh sweet, sweet stogie, how I have missed you...' WHERE `word_id` = 140073; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=5214
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh thank you, $N! You saved my harvest! And I hope you showed a few of those Defias that they can\'t cause trouble around here.$B$BWe might be short on guards these days, but we\'re lucky to have heroes like you to protect us!' WHERE `word_id` = 138582; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=3904
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh thank you, thank you! I know a bit of alchemy, I\'m not totally useless. Here goes...' WHERE `word_id` = 177722; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25521
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh thank you, thank you! You\'ve saved me from having to go out in the woods with those awful things! At least for a day, that is...' WHERE `word_id` = 182106; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=26721
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh that\'s right Private $N, don\'t make any effort to help me unload this soil up on to the piles! If the Great Spirits had wanted it done they would have miracled it up there, now wouldn\'t they?!$B$BArch Druid Runetotem wants to speak with you again, but for his next task you find that a journeyman\'s understanding of Herbalism would be helpful. If you don\'t know it though, he\'ll still find a use for you.' WHERE `word_id` = 138436; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=3761
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh the chickens I will craft from this wondrous husk! Well done, my $Gboy:girl; !' WHERE `word_id` = 144426; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=8857
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh wow, baby! Everyone is here! Who cares about some stupid dragon?$B$BWe setup the party around the pool. Sounds like they\'re having a great time already. You are going to look so fine!$B$BWhy don\'t you head over to the pool and keep everyone entertained? I\'ll join you in a moment... I just have to grab my stuff.' WHERE `word_id` = 173407; -- locales_quest - details : entry=14153
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh ya, this be the good stuff. I pack it up real nice so it not go to waste. Thanks be to you for helpin\' me out like this. I\'m thinkin\' you an A-number-one fisherman for all this spotted yellowtail. An if you happen to fish up and cook even more, you bring it to me here; I make sure everyone know you did!' WHERE `word_id` = 144035; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=8613
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh yay! Happy little deer! Now they can grow up and have ADVENTURES. You\'re swell.' WHERE `word_id` = 177321; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25392
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh yeah this is gonna be good!$B$BStand back... I\'m gonna call down the wrath of the blood ritual!' WHERE `word_id` = 161324; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=12814
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh yeah!  I was supposed to put together a report!  I\'d almost forgotten!$B$BLooks like mostly harmless wildlife around here... \'cept for those blasted eels... and a few murlocs. Cap\'n will be more interested in the murlocs, I think.$B$BGo engage a few of \'em in combat and see what kinda moves they got. From what I\'ve seen, the big ones hunt for fish in the kelp, and the little ones practice some kind o\' magic or another... but that\'s all I know.' WHERE `word_id` = 179608; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26018
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh yeah! I love the smell of freshly-cratered dirt! Word around camp is that the elven front line is collapsing back toward the river. Talk to Chawg and see if there\'s anything you can do to help seal the deal.' WHERE `word_id` = 174550; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=24430
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh yeah! Look at all that booty. Wait a minute... bring it closer!' WHERE `word_id` = 178022; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25609
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh yeah! This is going to be the greatest flavor in the world! Look out, Tigule and Foror!!!' WHERE `word_id` = 186692; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28045
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh yeah, about the ripple dad wants! He wants to sell the ripple to a tavern here in Orgrimmar, but we\'ll get more money if it is in its original packaging. I know someone who can do that, and he\'s in the Hinterlands where the ripple is. But he\'s, um, a high elf.$B$BWell, he\'s a good high elf, as he\'s not a part of the Alliance. Well, he\'s not so much a good high elf as he is a drunken high elf. He loves, and I mean LOVES the hooch.' WHERE `word_id` = 132919; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=649
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh yeah, I remember this book. Its owner rented a room for a few days, and spent his nights at the bar, writing.$B$BHe left town in a hurry, muttering about being hunted by...something. Last I saw him he was heading west out of town, looking for a new spot to hide.$B$BThe first place he\'d find to the west is Raven Hill...' WHERE `word_id` = 131259; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=266
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh yeah, you\'re going to look hot! You\'re going to replace the Trade Prince any day now at the rate you\'re going! I can\'t wait to be a kept man! Let me have all that stuff and I\'ll help you get into it right before the party.' WHERE `word_id` = 173294; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=14110
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh yeah. YEAH! These are DEFINITELY going to kill somebody. Probably naga.' WHERE `word_id` = 185015; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27586
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh yes, I just got the perfume and cologne in stock recently. It\'s been selling so well, I don\'t know how long I can keep it on the shelves.$B$BIf you ask me, it\'s kind of boring. Everyone smelling the same? It smells great, but still.' WHERE `word_id` = 144842; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=9026
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh yes. Parts for Kravel. I\'m glad you\'re here. These things have been sitting out here for days, and I was afraid they\'d rust!' WHERE `word_id` = 134797; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=1111
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh yes... I was wise to ask you to get these. How fascinating. Come here, my pretties. Into the bag you go.' WHERE `word_id` = 180635; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=26310
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh you sweet, sweet $C! I had no idea that those disgusting Grimscale murlocs had also pirated away with my navigation rudders! Without them, I would have no chance of navigating the seas again once we retake the anchorage and repair the ship.$B$BThank you very much! Here, take this coin as a sign of my appreciation.' WHERE `word_id` = 146154; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=8887
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh you\'re a darling, even if it did take you longer than I am accustomed to. This shipment should make me quite a bit of money once I\'ve cleaned and personalized these hats. And seeing as I\'m always willing to reward work that\'s well done, here\'s a little something for you. I suggest that you spend some of it on a bath sweetie.' WHERE `word_id` = 143412; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=8365
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh!  Yeah, the undead. Here\'s your coin, bugger off.' WHERE `word_id` = 158273; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=12043
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh! Oh... you took care of Netherock. Good news that!$B$BWith that troublesome mountain giant out of the picture, we should have an easier time of exploi... er, husbanding the resources of the Crumbling Wastes.$B$BGlad to hear that those poor, innocent elementals down there won\'t be getting squished by him.$B$BHow ever can I repay you?' WHERE `word_id` = 152019; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10701
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh! This is it! It\'s the big one! We\'re in business boys!' WHERE `word_id` = 174642; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=24458
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh! Well, this is a different matter entirely. You probably don\'t realize the gravity of this matter yet, do you?$B$BI care deeply about Hammertoe\'s demise, but if he sent you here with his amulet, then he understood what\'s at stake.$B$BWe will have to take time to mourn his death later.$B$BLet me show you one of the reasons this amulet is so valuable.' WHERE `word_id` = 133247; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=724
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, $N, you have saved my daughter! I know the power of the moonstone will give back my daughter her strength!$B$BI can never repay you fully for the aid you have given me, but... please, take this. Other than Relara, it is my most dear possession.' WHERE `word_id` = 134468; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=1035
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, $N, you have saved my daughter! I know the power of the moonstones will give back my daughter her strength! I can never repay you fully for the aid you have given me, but... please, take this. Other than Relara, it is my most dear possession.' WHERE `word_id` = 172826; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=13924
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, $N, you\'re just the best!$B$BHere\'s your coin as promised.' WHERE `word_id` = 157192; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=11645
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, and just as I was nearly out. Thank you!' WHERE `word_id` = 190260; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=29334
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, aye! Kilts for the gents, gowns for the bridesmaids. Just don\'t tell the ladies they\'re wearing clothes fit for a blimp.' WHERE `word_id` = 188170; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28410
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, before you go, $N... I have a message for you. There\'s someone in Hearthglen who\'d like to meet with you. Said he\'s "heard your name pop up" a few times already.$B$BConsider yourself lucky, $N. Not everybody gets a personal audience with Highlord Tirion Fordring.$B$BOh, and feel free to use one of my mustangs for the ride up there. They\'re the fastest money can buy.' WHERE `word_id` = 183109; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27002
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, blast! I thought forgetting my kit would free me from work. Now I guess I\'ll have to help the Larsons with their sewing...$B$BOh, well. Fun will come later I guess.' WHERE `word_id` = 131555; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=334
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, bless ya, $N, bless ya!$B$BJust set \'em down right where yer standin\'. I\'ll have one o\' the boys come load \'em up soon enough and we can stop worryin\' \'bout runnin\' out o\' balls ta shoot at Skorn.' WHERE `word_id` = 155412; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=11190
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, bless your heart, to do such a thing for a married woman like me. You\'re too kind.' WHERE `word_id` = 178834; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25820
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, Coppernickels finally decided to report his findings, did he?  Lazy scientists!$B$BWhat\'s this?$B$B<The chief riffles through the notations a few times, clearly with a look of disbelief.>$B$BHe says here that the violent nether-energies flowing through the Netherstorm are going to rip everything to shreds in only a few months.$B$BThat\'s inconvenient - now we\'ll have to move up the time-table on building the rocket ship!' WHERE `word_id` = 149974; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10183
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, Deputy Willem told you to speak with me? He\'s a brave man and always willing to help, but his duties keep him stuck at Northshire Abbey and I\'m afraid the problem I have today is beyond him.$B$BPerhaps you can help me?' WHERE `word_id` = 138579; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=3903
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, excellent!  I\'ve been waiting to get my hands on a piece of that thing, but Tola\'thion\'s been dragging his feet.$B$BHe\'s supposed to be out here helping me to investigate what\'s going on up on Fallen Sky Ridge. Instead he\'s just been sending poor dupes like you - no offense - up there into the slaughter mill.$B$BIf you give me the crystal maybe I can find a link between it and the colossi.' WHERE `word_id` = 150741; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10349
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, excellent! I can\'t wait to measure the effects from this latest batch!$B$BWell, you did an admirable job, sweetie. Wish I could give you more than this for the entertainment you\'ve provided, but you know how it is. There\'s not much money to be made out here in the swamp.$B$BI\'m sure it was worth it just for the fun!' WHERE `word_id` = 147009; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=9440
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, excellent! I won\'t have to hear complaints about dull blades anymore. Thank you, $N.' WHERE `word_id` = 144319; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=8781
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, finally... I don\'t know how much longer I can last!' WHERE `word_id` = 185390; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27685
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, fortune is with us! Thank you! We may yet be saved!' WHERE `word_id` = 133178; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=709
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, girl! You\'re never going to guess who\'s out on the oil platform to the north.$B$B<Izzy shakes her head sadly at you.>$B$BChip\'s out there, and he\'s working for the Trade Prince. That cold-hearted snake dropped you like a bad habit and now he\'s working for the other team. I even heard he\'s going out with that tramp, Candy Cane!$B$BI don\'t know about you, but if he was my ex, I\'d rip his still-beating heart out of his chest.' WHERE `word_id` = 176713; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25202
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, good... help finally!  There\'s just so much to do, and I need to stay here to organize it all.$B$BI hope that you\'re ready to get your hands dirty.' WHERE `word_id` = 147991; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=9697
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, goodness, you must be the help I requested weeks ago from Falcon Watch.$B$BWell, you\'re here now and there\'s a lot to be done. I have just the thing to start you out.' WHERE `word_id` = 151074; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10442
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, goodness, you must be the help that I requested from the Temple of Telhamat.$B$BI\'m glad that you\'re here; there\'s a lot to be done, and I have just the thing to start you out.' WHERE `word_id` = 151077; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10443
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, gosh! You\'re back so soon! I saw you take off and you shot up like a rocket! I was sure it would take at least a month of convalescing to mend the broken legs from that flight! You\'re tough, and brave, and foolhardy! But mostly... you\'re brave!' WHERE `word_id` = 152065; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10711
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, great!  You got them!$B$BThanks, $N. You\'re a real lifesaver!' WHERE `word_id` = 137322; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=2865
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, hallelujah, and praise, praise be to the Light, my brother!' WHERE `word_id` = 184620; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27479
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, hello there $N. Marcia said you\'d be coming by with that poor man\'s missing arm.$B$BShe also gave me this bag to give you as a reward. It smells horrible, and I\'m anxious to make the trade if you don\'t mind.' WHERE `word_id` = 164384; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=13836
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, hello, luv. How go your adventures? Oh, I\'m so glad to hear you\'re doing well.$B$BOh, me? Thank you for asking--I\'m doing well, all things considered.$B$BThe increase in tradesmen has kind of put a damper on the amount of leather and cloth people are willing to part with these days, so it\'s been tougher to make clothing for the children at the orphanage, but we\'ll manage. By "we" I mean my husband and I. He\'s up in Ironforge trying to seek help from the citizens there.' WHERE `word_id` = 136011; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=1643
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, hey!  There you are!' WHERE `word_id` = 173758; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=14269
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, hi! Did Farlus send you? I\'m so happy he remembered!$B$BBloodvenom Post is all overrun with awful slime thingies, and this poor tauren is the only one left! We\'ve got to help him!' WHERE `word_id` = 187731; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28305
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, ho hello there! You can only be here for one reason: to open your Winter Veil presents.$B$BNow, don\'t you worry, Greatfather Winter hasn\'t forgotten about his favorite $R $C. Look under the tree and you\'ll find your gifts.$B$BDuring this season of giving, perhaps your friends would also enjoy receiving some of Smokeywood Pasture\'s excellent products?' WHERE `word_id` = 144404; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=8827
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, ho! That was beautiful. I probably shouldn\'t have stayed to watch. Now that they\'re looking for you, I\'ll slip quietly away in the dust of their aimless gallopin\'. Be sure to look for my buds at the other pools. Boss has agents at every one.' WHERE `word_id` = 173032; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=13992
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, how nice of those dear furbolg. I feel so bad for them, cooped up in that hold, afraid of the world. But can you blame them? These Winterfall furbolg are turning just as vicious as any in Felwood. I\'d like to put a stop to it... if only for the sake of my own research, let alone the dear Timbermaw.' WHERE `word_id` = 188453; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28524
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, I am so glad you found me! I must admit, I am a bit lost... But isn\'t this a beautiful place?' WHERE `word_id` = 137235; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=2844
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, I am so happy Kerlonian made it! And I\'m sure I\'ll find him sleeping somewhere around here, won\'t I?$B$BThank you for showing him the way, $N.' WHERE `word_id` = 140270; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=5321
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, I can see you have promise, yes you do! But it takes more than promise to be a good $C. And if you\'re not a good $C, then you\'re a bad $C. And bad $Cs are part of the problem, yes they are!$B$BOops, I\'m getting ahead of things. Let\'s begin at the start!' WHERE `word_id` = 136408; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=1879
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, I do smell something tasty! I hope you gave that bird quite a good beating.$B$BPlease, help yourself to some of my extra stock. I\'m sure someone of your talent could put it to good use.' WHERE `word_id` = 154236; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=11377
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, I knew you could do it, $C, I just knew it! I\'ll get these into the right hands as soon as I can. Now, let\'s see here. Hmm, looks like our tally is coming along rather nicely. You should check back with me in just a moment once I\'m done counting to see if we need more. Cuz if we do, you\'re the one I want out there gathering it up for me!' WHERE `word_id` = 143724; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=8515
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, I\'ve missed Dornaa so much. Thank you for bringing her to visit. It gets lonely here with only the ethereal around. And they\'re so serious all the time with this Oshu\'gun business.$B$BBut I get to go back and visit the orphanage after I pass my gemcutting exams. I almost passed them last week, but I\'m sure that I\'ll do better on the test tomorrow!' WHERE `word_id` = 273584; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10954
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, isn\'t that sweet! This is the first time he\'s ever sent me something. Do you suppose he\'s getting serious?$B$BColara Heldric? I suppose it has a ring to it. Oh, but I\'m getting ahead of myself. Thank you.' WHERE `word_id` = 144499; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=8897
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, it\'s blood. It must be from master Mor\'zul then. He is so enamored with the stuff, and loves to see it spilled. I, however, prefer it coursing through the veins of a small rodent. It stays warm that way... until you want it.$B$BThis is powerful blood. Mor\'zul must be making another parchment to summon a dreadsteed! How exciting!$B$BIf that\'s true, and you\'re going to perform the ritual, then... you\'re going to need a lot more than blood, my friend.' WHERE `word_id` = 142162; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=7564
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, it\'s going to be so much nicer around here now that they\'re gone! At least until more show up. But thank you!' WHERE `word_id` = 176147; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25049
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, it\'s great to see you again $N! I\'m afraid I\'m going to need your help.$B$BYou see, Mograine\'s the Commander here along with High Inquisitor Whitemane, and they tried telling me that I wasn\'t really the new Scarlet Champion! \'Course, the boys and I didn\'t take kindly to that.$B$BWe\'re taking the Scarlet Monastery for our own and re-establishing the order as it always should have been - with me at the head of things! I\'ll take care of the Forsaken and the Scourge for good.$B$BHelp an old friend out?' WHERE `word_id` = 182999; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26976
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, it\'s just wonderful!  I mean, it looks pretty old... and yeah, someone sure did blow it up. But just look at it!$B$BOoh, and did you look up at the sky?$B$BNeato!' WHERE `word_id` = 273576; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10950
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, it\'s you again! I\'m so surprised!' WHERE `word_id` = 188842; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28627
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, it\'s you, ma\'am! Sorry, I didn\'t recognize you at first with all of these commoners milling about. You people cool your heels! $N is here! Here are your macaroons, ma\'am. Come back anytime if you need more.' WHERE `word_id` = 182070; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=26711
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, it\'s you, sir! Sorry, I didn\'t recognize you at first with all of these commoners milling about. You people cool your heels! $N is here! Here are your macaroons, sir. Come back anytime if you need more.' WHERE `word_id` = 182072; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=26712
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, it\'s you.$B$BI had hoped Serinar would simply return himself once the task was done... I suppose he\'s distracted by something or another to kill. He\'s missing out on a gloriously messy battle!$B$BAre you still here? I\'m done with you.' WHERE `word_id` = 159271; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=12266
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, look at him!  Isn\'t he the most adorable thing you\'ve ever seen?  Thank you, $N. I feel more energetic already.' WHERE `word_id` = 175866; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=24974
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, mon - shimmercap stew! I can almost taste it already....' WHERE `word_id` = 159877; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=12483
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, mon! I can\'t thank you enough! Hopefully this here fishing pole will be reward enough for the job.' WHERE `word_id` = 142506; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=26211
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, mon, this gonna be good. One more step to go and Wildhammer see that they can\'t mess with troll!' WHERE `word_id` = 142554; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=7842
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, most excellent! Thank you. The crystals appear to be in fine condition!$B$BI have no doubt that Pestlepot put you up to doing his chores for him. Nevertheless, your assistance in this matter is greatly appreciated!' WHERE `word_id` = 160058; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=12527
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, most excellent, $N. This is most excellent.$B$BSuch a tale. Who would have thought the two would interact with one another in such a way... I will have to spend more time looking at the environmental issues that cause changes in these creatures.$B$BI will continue my research for now. Perhaps we will speak again soon. Until then, I wish you well.' WHERE `word_id` = 139266; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=4642
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, my shield! I won\'t be using it anytime soon, but thank you. I hate that I\'m sitting here useless when I could be helping on the front, but fighting with my arm like this won\'t help anyone.$B$BTake care out there, won\'t you?' WHERE `word_id` = 164572; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=13986
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, my Smokywood supplies! Splendid! I\'ll need these to feed all the people in town for the celebration!$B$BThank you, $N. Please take this as payment, and don\'t forget to drink and dance with the revelers outside!' WHERE `word_id` = 144441; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=8860
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, my son... my beautiful son.$B$BUncertain of my son\'s fate, I have tormented myself since he left. Now that I know what\'s happened, perhaps I can finally begin to mourn.$B$BThank you, $N. Please take this. I was going to give it to Kron as a gift when he returned successful. Now that I know he is dead, I cannot bear to look at it.' WHERE `word_id` = 133581; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=816
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, my uncle sent you, did he?$B$BWell I\'ve been researching recipes and I have some leads, but I need help.$B$BHelp from someone willing to get his feet wet.' WHERE `word_id` = 135261; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=1260
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, my! That\'s some of the biggest, juiciest tail I\'ve ever seen!' WHERE `word_id` = 177310; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25389
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, no, $N, this is going to be a disaster if we don\'t find some chicken soon... Ye just cannae make cock-a-leekie soup without the chicken! It\'s not possible!$B$BThere\'s still time to make the soup and broth if ye can find some fresh chicken. Will ye help me? There are usually a few chickens running around outside the front entrance to the city. If ye can get yer hands on, say, six o\' them, that should save me soup.' WHERE `word_id` = 190315; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29352
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, now that\'s pretty. Looks a lot like those gronn that are always bossing the Bladespire ogres around.$B$BOdd that you should find it in the hands of one of the Bloodmaul leaders.' WHERE `word_id` = 152379; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10797
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, Oilfist sent you?  Hah! Did he ever tell you how he got the name Oilfist?  You\'ll have to ask him about that one sometime.' WHERE `word_id` = 188422; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28514
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, Raene sent you? It must be serious indeed. What can I help you with?' WHERE `word_id` = 134421; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=1024
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, raspberries! Just when we had saved the last bear cub from the treetops, the fires returned and scared them again!$B$BI don\'t know if you know this, but baby bears are precious and soft.$B$BGo to the Whistling Grove, far to the northwest. Climb the trees, grab the bear cubs, and chuck them - gently! - to the soft target in the center of the grove.$B$B<Without warning, Mylune suddenly smashes you against her bosom and begins sobbing.>$B$BLil\' b-b-b-baby bears! Save them, $N!' WHERE `word_id` = 190022; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29161
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, right, I received a notification from someone a few days ago. The Reliquary, was it?  They\'re looking for someone to... do something...$B$B<The Warlord rifles through some papers.>$B$BAh, here it is!  Yes, Rohan Sunveil of The Reliquary is seeking able-bodied adventurers to assist with an archaeological expedition to the south.$B$BHere, take this with you. Why don\'t you go speak with that elf?' WHERE `word_id` = 178374; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25696
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, so Branstock sent ya, did he? Good, good! He\'s right, it is \'bout time you started taking a much larger step into the Light. It\'ll build character and make ya stronger... an\' that\'s what you\'ll need more than anything: strength of body... strength of will.' WHERE `word_id` = 140540; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=5626
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, so Menara sent you. Fair enough... I suppose you may stay as my guest for the time being. But you must be on some pressing business - perhaps you\'re here seeking lost power? Maybe I\'m mistaken. Maybe corruption isn\'t too far away from you after all.' WHERE `word_id` = 136293; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=1799
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, so Takrin sent you? He\'s an excellent scout, I\'m not sure what I\'d do without him.$B$BI\'ll sign your recruitment letter, but what we really need is someone at the Crossroads.' WHERE `word_id` = 133680; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=840
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, so Troyas Moonbreeze sent you?$B$B<mutters>...always bothering me with his wild notions that he found something important...$B$BLook, $N, I\'ll be blunt. Troyas always thinks he has found something important in those ruins. The truth is, anything that was truly valuable was probably hoarded away long ago by the ogres or the harpies that now reside there.$B$BYou\'re welcome to take a look around, but I don\'t know if you\'ll find any books here that will help you.' WHERE `word_id` = 137488; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=2939
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, splendid day! When I made the gizmonitor I never realized how dependent on it I would become. Now I can begin my studies anew!$B$BThank you, $N! And here - these were my first tools as a $C. They\'re a little scratched but they\'re well tested. Take your pick - I\'m sure you\'ll find either of them useful.' WHERE `word_id` = 136411; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=1880
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, splendid! I can use this ore to make my dye, and then can finish copying The Stresses of Iron.$B$BThank you, $N!' WHERE `word_id` = 131608; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=347
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, splendid! The venom is quite fresh and I\'m sure very deadly. Thank you!' WHERE `word_id` = 137464; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=2934
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, sure of course I know what you\'re talking about. Nope, can\'t help you though. Some of my men were supposed to go track down the blueprints for the fuel regulator, but they came back empty-handed.' WHERE `word_id` = 135063; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=1181
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, sweetie! You\'re never going to guess who\'s down in the slave pits to the north.$B$B<Sassy shakes her head sadly at you.>$B$BCandy\'s down there, and she\'s working for the Trade Prince. She dropped you like a bad habit and now she\'s working for the other team. but it gets worse. Since you "dealt" with Chip, she\'s dating the Trade Prince!$B$BI don\'t know about you, but if she were my ex, I\'d rip her fickle heart right out of her chest.' WHERE `word_id` = 176864; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25243
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, thank goodness you\'ve come. We have much to do.' WHERE `word_id` = 146762; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=9371
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, thank heavens that you survived, $N! I thought for sure that you\'d drowned when I saw you go over the side! Look at all of these folks you saved!' WHERE `word_id` = 173065; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=14001
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, thank the heavens you are here!' WHERE `word_id` = 131433; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=305
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, thank the Light the powder is here. But it is troubling news that you bring as well. To think that the Dark Irons have sympathizers able to procure this sort of material for their dastardly plans.$B$BThat\'s a matter for someone else to consider, some other time. I must put this powder to good use.' WHERE `word_id` = 131449; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=309
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, thank you for freeing me! You - ranked number one. Everyone else - ranked number two or lower.$B$BI knew my life was destined for more than just being an appetizer to some ogre!' WHERE `word_id` = 140424; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=5525
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, thank you! May the Light bless your good works, kind $Glord:lady;. The shadow of the Dark Horseman yet looms, but at least, for now, the village is safe from his flames.' WHERE `word_id` = 153754; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=11131
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, thank you! May the Light bless your good works, kind $Gsir:lady;. The shadow of the Dark Horseman yet looms, but at least, for now, the village is safe from his flames.' WHERE `word_id` = 158680; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=12135
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, thank you, $N! I feared I would never see Mist again, knowing only her death in my heart, never to be united with my faithful companion. I owe you more than you can know, and you have my eternal gratitude.' WHERE `word_id` = 134098; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=938
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, thank you, $N! I was afraid that it was lost for good!$B$B<She quickly empties the contents of the ooze-covered bag onto the ground, before scooping them up.>$B$BHm, I don\'t have much use for this anymore, but wash it off and I\'m sure you could make use of it.' WHERE `word_id` = 132151; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=470
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, thank you, $N! It\'s of no practical use to me, but the sentimental value... Needless to say, thank you for bringing this to me... at some cost to your own well-being, not to mention the time it took to go all the way down to Westfall. You have my gratitude, and have this as a token of my thanks.' WHERE `word_id` = 131841; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=399
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, thank you, thank you.$B$BYou\'ve helped us to live another day. Perhaps there\'s hope yet.' WHERE `word_id` = 159376; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=12288
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, that\'s a nice one!  No, I don\'t mean it\'s "nice" like cool juice is nice on a hot day.$B$BIn fact, it\'s very NOT nice now that I think about it. Not the juice. The orb!$B$BFocus, $N!  We\'ll need you focused if we\'re ever to finish our task!' WHERE `word_id` = 136528; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=1954
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, that\'s disgustin\'! We almost there, mon. Just need ta do one more ting!' WHERE `word_id` = 178266; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25672
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, that\'s the stuff all right! Hope ya didn\'t eat any. Gives you the cramps something awful but it does wonders for birds.' WHERE `word_id` = 184778; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27515
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, there they are. Great work, handsome!  Here\'s some gold. You\'ve earned it.' WHERE `word_id` = 175300; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=24700
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, these are exquisite! The commander will be able to make a winter uniform with these.' WHERE `word_id` = 186269; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27928
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, these are nice. Real nice... Good job, $N. I look forward to seeing more of your work in the future.' WHERE `word_id` = 133792; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=867
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, these are very nice! I\'ve gotten so tired of robotic squirrels and chickens for company. It\'ll be wonderful to have a pet whose joints won\'t require oiling!' WHERE `word_id` = 160657; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=12658
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, they\'re so cute! I wish that we could turn them into little plush toys and sell them for a gazillion macaroons!' WHERE `word_id` = 175551; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=24864
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, this is extraordinary! I had no idea... it\'s almost as if those crystals are alive.$B$BI wonder if there\'s some sort of symbiotic relationship between them and the nether drakes?$B$BThank you, thank you! You must accept a little something from my collection of odds and ends that I wouldn\'t be caught dead wearing.$B$BOne of them might look good on you, though.' WHERE `word_id` = 151635; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10594
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, this is great! Nice feel to it too!$B$BWhat? Oh, yeah... geologists. Got \'em good, did ya? I can\'t thank ya enough, $N. That\'ll give me some time to finish up in here... I mean, it\'ll let me not have to worry about them comin\' back for me anytime soon. Thanks again.' WHERE `word_id` = 139119; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=4449
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, this is wonderful!  Thank you, $N!  I\'ll get to work immediately!!$B$BPoor, poor Techbot... Don\'t feel bad. We\'ll get you fixed.$B$BNow, where did I put that plug for my hydro-jack swivel spanner...' WHERE `word_id` = 137409; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=2922
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, those are lovely! I can\'t wait to put them in some water!$B$BBut...these are Martie\'s favorite flowers. Parker didn\'t have you go to that jealous vixen for this bouquet, did he? You didn\'t tell her who they were for, did you? If you did, then it wouldn\'t surprise me if she poisoned them.$B$BOh, but it\'s not your fault. Thank you, and here\'s your meal.' WHERE `word_id` = 130689; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=131
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, those look splendid. These cultists certainly have an eye for craftsmanship.$B$BToo bad for them that it\'s misdirected.$B$BAnd now that we have the nets, would you be willing to help little old me with a thing or two?' WHERE `word_id` = 152096; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10717
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, Trias sent you, huh? That\'s a little different.$B$BFeel free to fight whatever monstrosities come at you from the darkness. I\'m sure you\'ll be able to handle it pretty easily if you\'re the type to be hanging around with the likes of him.$B$BSo, what does my friend need of me on such a gloomy day as this?' WHERE `word_id` = 135213; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=1243
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, very good! These supplies will help feed all our people, here to celebrate the new year!$B$BI thank you, $N. You are in my debt. Please, take these coins... and heed my advice - drink heartily from the kegs outside, and join our revelers in a dance of celebration!' WHERE `word_id` = 144445; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=8861
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, we know a thing or two about this Soggoth. The question is... do you really want to know?' WHERE `word_id` = 172740; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=13896
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, well done... I told you to jump in a pond, and you did. I can only imagine what you\'d do if one of your good friends asked it of you.$B$BIf you want a reward for your efforts, it is this: never lift a finger without first knowing what\'s in it for you. The $C\'s mind is his greatest weapon. Remember that and try to use yours a bit more.' WHERE `word_id` = 146870; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=9402
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, what might have been...' WHERE `word_id` = 178581; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25743
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, what\'s this? A samophlange, you say? What\'s a samophlange??$B$BAh... but look at the way it moves when you handle it. And there\'s the sound of intricate gears inside. Oh my! I want to fix it and see what it does, don\'t you??' WHERE `word_id` = 138623; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=29026
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, wonderful! Give it here -- let me drink it!' WHERE `word_id` = 136978; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=2605
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, wonderful! I\'ll be able to start reassembling these right away. Thank you so much!' WHERE `word_id` = 178979; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25855
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, wonderful! Those are fine cuts! These are from Zargh, are they? That orc sure knows his way into a lady\'s heart...$B$BOh, I can\'t wait to cook it. But not too much! Meat is best served rare, don\'t you think?' WHERE `word_id` = 141261; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=6384
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, wow! These are worth a fortune. I just hope that the Trade Prince doesn\'t notice them when you hand them over with the rest of your wealth....' WHERE `word_id` = 173336; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=14123
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, wow. That is not pretty. I\'m sure the merchant will appreciate it more than me.$B$BAs payment, the merchant offered to buy one of my special stock items for you, so take your pick sweetie!' WHERE `word_id` = 151430; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10548
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, yeah! Arcane Arts... of course.$B$BHere\'s what you need to know, $N: Don\'t get into too much trouble. Save some coin to buy me an ale... or any spells ya might want. And stay the heck away from Gnomeregan. Other than that, have a good day! I\'ll be here if you need me or want to train... or whatever.' WHERE `word_id` = 137858; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=3114
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, yes I can check that for you. Let\'s see...last week it was...$B$B...why, it was Private Merle scheduled with Thorsen. They had the same patrol times all of last week.' WHERE `word_id` = 131537; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=330
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, yes! This will teach those elves, just you watch!' WHERE `word_id` = 172502; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=13730
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, you are going to look so fine, but not as gorgeous as me! You\'re going to replace the Trade Prince any day now at the rate you\'re going! I can\'t wait to not have to work anymore! You\'re going to buy me everything that I want, right babe? Let me have all that stuff and I\'ll help you get into it right before the party.' WHERE `word_id` = 173292; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=14109
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, you found it! I will place the tear in a stew, and pray that it will cure her.$B$BThank you! Thank you, $N!' WHERE `word_id` = 134458; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=1033
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, you found it! Odd... it looks tarnished somehow. I will place the tear in a stew, and pray that it will cure her. Thank you! Thank you, $N!' WHERE `word_id` = 181194; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=26475
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, you found it! Thank you, thank you dear!$B$BHere, take this. It was my husband\'s and he always said it was lucky. If only he didn\'t forget it on his last campaign! *sniff*' WHERE `word_id` = 130489; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=87
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, you got them! Splendid! I must begin studying the Arm of Gri\'lek immediately!' WHERE `word_id` = 132451; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=540
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, you must be one of the survivors we\'ve been hearing about!$B$BI\'m glad that you came. Don\'t worry, we will send someone to see to Aeun\'s injured leg.$B$BI\'m most interested in hearing all about your harrowing story of survival. You\'re a brave one to have made it all the way here.' WHERE `word_id` = 146659; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=9314
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, you took readings from the nether-weather vane? Splendid! The data gained from this instrument -- coupled with my measurements of druid magic -- will bear much fruit!$B$BOh, the applications will boggle the mind, I assure you!' WHERE `word_id` = 152071; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10712
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, you want to talk?  Fine.$B$BI\'m Jurrix, the only merc here with half a brain. The only one with any bite to my attacks, too. The only reason I keep these meat shields around is to keep myself from getting killed.$B$BListen, you\'re the boss of this operation. You give the word, and I\'ll send a fireball right through your target\'s heart. If things start getting hectic, I can even warp time a bit so you can fit in a few extra attacks.$B$BWhy don\'t we go try fighting together?' WHERE `word_id` = 186135; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27892
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, you were sent here by Tiala? A wonderful student, she\'ll do many great things. Although I sense even greater potential from you. Please, stay a while in our shrine. There\'s much to do, but you can\'t accomplish anything with a troubled mind.' WHERE `word_id` = 179501; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25985
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, YOU\'RE the great savior of OOX-09/HL! I cannot even begin to express my thanks for your assistance! My homing robot series needs more development, but your recovery has saved me countless hours of extra rebuilding time, as well as many gold pieces in manufacture costs!$B$BPlease, take your choice of any of these items I have. Thank you again for your generous assistance $N, my robots and I are in your debt!' WHERE `word_id` = 133666; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=836
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, YOU\'RE the great savior of OOX-17/TN! I cannot even begin to express my thanks for your assistance! My homing robot series needs more developing, but your recovery has saved me countless hours of rebuilding time, as well as many gold pieces in rebinding costs!$B$BPlease, take your choice of any of these items I have. Hopefully, you will make good use of one of them. Thank you again for your generous assistance, my robots and I are in your debt!' WHERE `word_id` = 132914; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=648
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, YOU\'RE the great savior of OOX-22/FE! I cannot even begin to express my thanks for your assistance! My homing robot series needs more development, but your recovery has saved me countless hours of extra rebuilding time, as well as many gold pieces in manufacture costs!$B$BPlease, take your choice of any of these items I have. Thank you again for your generous assistance $N, my robots and I are in your debt!' WHERE `word_id` = 137159; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25476
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, you\'ve done it!  I can now make my potion and use it on Rocknot. Finally, he will fall victim to my charms!$B$BThank you, $N. You are a champion of love!' WHERE `word_id` = 138898; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=4201
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, you\'ve done it! Wonderful! Thank you, $N.$B$BOh, my poor, A-Me. Look at all those dents. We\'ll get her up and running perfectly with just a little work.$B$BThank you again, $N. I really appreciate it.' WHERE `word_id` = 138925; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=4245
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, you\'ve found them! I was sure they were lost forever... Here you are, $N. I hope this is ample payment.' WHERE `word_id` = 177315; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25390
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh, you\'ve seen fit to do some of the work I requested. Excellent. And here I thought you were going to ask me to craft you something.$B$BThese are all perfect... and everything\'s here. Thank you, $C.$B$BMaybe it wouldn\'t hurt to reward you some... hmm, what would you find useful.' WHERE `word_id` = 139124; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=4450
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh. Greetings, brother.$B$BAnd praise to the dwellers beneath.' WHERE `word_id` = 133260; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=727
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh. Visitors?' WHERE `word_id` = 188220; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28442
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh. You\'re still alive. Not bad.' WHERE `word_id` = 177641; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25499
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh... hey, that\'sh different!$B$BOkay, let me shee that shtuff. I jusht love tinkering with alchemy!$B$BInteresting, interesting... here, I think I know jusht what to do. A little mixing of that with the jusht the right amount of thish.$B$BYou know, I think a little dash of this rotgut will help, too ...hic!' WHERE `word_id` = 156374; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=11328
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh... I have never seen anything like this...' WHERE `word_id` = 141727; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=6981
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh... I\'m so glad someone found me...' WHERE `word_id` = 139158; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=4492
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh... Me spine... Brother, is that you?' WHERE `word_id` = 190124; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=29213
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh... mud. You brought me mud? Wow - this stuff oozes with power! I see what Thordun was saying, now. I\'ll distribute this to all of the healers. Our wounded will be on their feet in no time!' WHERE `word_id` = 184878; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27538
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh... wow... it\'s some really old food. Hey Hol\'anyee, take a look at this!  This $R brought us those old rations that we abandoned! No, not from Marshal\'s Refuge... from the old base camp! I\'m not sure I want to peek inside. I\'ll just give it to Nolen, I guess... he\'ll know what to do with it.' WHERE `word_id` = 175556; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=24865
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh... Yes, these things do look familiar... well, kind of...' WHERE `word_id` = 138540; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=3845
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh...my poor Thurman! I begged him to leave Agamand Mills with me and my father, but his family loyalty was too strong! And I knew it! I just knew it that Brand meant him harm!! Oh, curse this Plague, and the Scourge!$B$B<Yvette\'s face then smoothes and grows cold.>$B$BBut regrets are for the weak. As a Forsaken, I have new goals and love is not one of them. I would thank you for delivering this letter, for I had wondered what happened to my past love.$B$BBut that life is over. Forever.' WHERE `word_id` = 131672; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=361
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh...my! I feel guilty deceiving my family, but my feelings for Tommy Joe are too strong to ignore.$B$BThank you, $N. I\'ll drink this liquor as soon as I have the chance and sneak away to my love.$B$BAnd for you... please take this.' WHERE `word_id` = 130607; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=114
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oh? A letter? Wonderful news! I\'ve been waiting on word from my dear old mother in Deathknell. Such a saint, she is. I wonder how she\'s holding up.$B$BWhat? Too cheery? Not buying it, are you?$B$BWell, get lost then... it\'s really no business who the letter\'s from anyway. Go on! Get lost!$B$BCome back when you\'ve got some coin to spend... loafer.$B$BNext thing you know, you\'ll be coming back to rest after a long days adventure or some stupid thing like that.' WHERE `word_id` = 130172; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=8
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Ohhh, these will do nicely! Thargad will be so surprised!' WHERE `word_id` = 174158; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=14379
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oi! Tasty, mon. Thank ya for your great kindness, young one. Da spirits shall surely be regardin\' ya with great favor.' WHERE `word_id` = 176104; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25037
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oi, $N!  I was told I\'d have company soon.' WHERE `word_id` = 180401; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=26247
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oi, this was a heavy one!  He nearly broke me gryphon\'s back! Are you ready to interrogate the ogre, $N?' WHERE `word_id` = 180414; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=26250
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oi, what\'re ye doin\' here in my camp? Bloody hell, why\'re ye in the Burnin\' Steppes at all? *hic*$B$BBah, it don\'t matter anyway.$B$BListen, I was adventurin\' the other day, as I often do, an\' I was ambushed by orcs from Blackrock Mountain! \'Cept one of \'em was different...dressed all funny an\' spoke all sophisticated like. Called hisself Acride, I think...$B$BYou ought to go to the Blackrock Spire and find that orc...just be watchin\', pretty much all of the others will want t\' kill ya. Tell him I sent ye!' WHERE `word_id` = 184582; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27469
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oil Drilling Rig defended' WHERE `word_id` = 178768; -- locales_quest - EndText : entry=25798
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oil Gusher ignited' WHERE `word_id` = 188075; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=28387
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oil Pump Destroyed' WHERE `word_id` = 179082; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=25878
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oil Slimes Siphoned' WHERE `word_id` = 189681; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=29050
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oil! Black gold! Tanaris Tea! We\'re rich! We just have to clear out the remaining pesky centaur. I\'m sure with all the money we\'re going to make, we can relocate them to some other bluff.' WHERE `word_id` = 178767; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25798
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='OK! Ingredient number one is down.$B$BNow, if you\'re up to it, we\'ll move on to something that\'ll give the shale oil that little extra kick that it\'ll need to blast the nether rocket into the Twisting Nether... or oblivion, whichever comes first.' WHERE `word_id` = 150708; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10342
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Ok, ok! Don\'t hurt us. We had the book but we sold it...' WHERE `word_id` = 150184; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10231
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Okay $N, that\'s it. I\'m not surprised in the slightest that Dodd was behind this. I never liked him, or his stupid moustache! It\'s time to FIGHT BACK!$B$BIn the mountains to the east lives a powerful creature known as Firebeak. He is the key to the Twilight Cultists\' destruction.$B$BFight the beast and show him that you\'re its master. When he is weakened, ride him down the pools to rain destruction upon our enemies!' WHERE `word_id` = 189694; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29057
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Okay! Using the spare parts you\'ve found for me, I\'ve got a framework roughed out for my versatile new assault vehicle. All I need now is a compact power supply.$B$BI\'ve noticed that the indigenous wildlife here packs quite the punch, electrostatically speaking. Can you hunt down Thunderheads near the base here and get me an intact electrogizard? It might take a few kills to find a usable gland.' WHERE `word_id` = 176269; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25080
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Okay, $N! Let\'s take these artifacts to my father and give him our report firsthand.$B$BThanks to your help my flying machine is ready to roll. We can fly there together and share in the glory.$B$BTalk to me when you\'re all set to move out!' WHERE `word_id` = 176415; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25120
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Okay, $N, we need to get to the earth portal at the back of the cave.$B$BI\'ve "procured" a ride for us. Why walk when we can ride in style? I hope you don\'t mind mine carts.$B$BLet me know when you\'re ready.' WHERE `word_id` = 185526; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27720
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Okay, $N. I think I can do this manually, but I\'ll need your help.' WHERE `word_id` = 188136; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28403
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Okay, $N. You\'re all set.$B$BI\'ve pre-programmed the path to Stonetalon, so all you\'ll need to worry about is keeping the bomb intact.$B$BYou can use the sawblades to mow down any enemies from a distance, or short-circuit a fuse to zap anyone who gets too close.$B$BYou have ONE chance to repair the bomb if it gets dangerously damaged. Use it wisely!$B$BSpeak to me when you think you\'re ready.$B$BGood luck!' WHERE `word_id` = 173035; -- locales_quest - details : entry=13993
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Okay, $R! Zhis just got real!$B$BSomevone zhinks zhat zhey can get rid of me zhat easily, hmm?$B$BVe shall see about zhat! Nozhink can shtop zhis vork! Nozhink!$B$B<Schnottz looks around at the encroaching flames.>$B$BVe should probably get out of here.$B$BHuury up! Time is vastink!' WHERE `word_id` = 275400; -- locales_quest - details : entry=28187
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Okay, babe, listen up. There\'s two ways to get people to do what you want. You can provide goods, services, and things people want...or you can beat the living daylights out of them.$B$BI\'ve often found it\'s useful to do both at the same time, and you\'re pretty familiar with both methods by now. Take these little silithid treats, go and beat some ogres dizzy, and then give them the treat before you knock them completely dead, \'kay?' WHERE `word_id` = 175820; -- locales_quest - details : entry=24963
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Okay, babe. Like I said, the ogres are too dumb to know what signing that charter meant. Now we have to actually get them to come along with us, so we\'ll be procuring what is apparently beloved local flavor.$B$BBeloved local flavor for drooling idiots, I mean.$B$BJust pop on over to the Noxious Lair to the west, it\'s that big horrible pit full of dangerous silithid. Kill a bunch of the Centipaar silithid and bring back the pieces so we can hand \'em out, okay? Ciao.' WHERE `word_id` = 175790; -- locales_quest - details : entry=24957
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Okay, I know this is a longshot, but I figure it never hurts to ask.$B$BWhile I deal with the fallout of all the ridiculous nonsense that just went on here, I need you to go speak to some bears. The Timbermaw furbolg control the forests to the northeast, and they\'re not too fond of us.$B$BI just need someone to give them the idea the Horde isn\'t all that bad. Head northeast up the road to Timbermaw Hold--don\'t go into Felpaw village--and ask the furbolg outside if they have any favors they\'d like done.' WHERE `word_id` = 188012; -- locales_quest - details : entry=28373
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Okay, I think that\'s good enough for now, but they took a bunch of the townsfolk captive. We\'re going to have to take the fight to them!' WHERE `word_id` = 175579; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=24901
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Okay, I\'ll let you in on the real work, since you\'re looking at me so desperately.$B$BThis rock is untapped! It\'s probably richer than a trade prince during a great war! I need samples. More samples. Samples from everywhere!$B$BI\'ve modified my earth totems to drill through the sand and store samples of the rock underneath. Go find a nice spot and plant one.$B$BThe shaking and rumbling will probably attract all the cute, curious wildlife, so maybe you can make some friends while you\'re at it.' WHERE `word_id` = 176780; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25217
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Okay, I\'ve softened this guy up, how about you help me finish him off?$B$BI\'ve got a plan for our escape, but it\'ll require a lot of guts and a little luck.$B$BYou up for it, $N?$B$BJust follow my lead...' WHERE `word_id` = 186175; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27905
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Okay, new plan. We\'ll SCARE it out of \'em! In my experience most large creatures are terrified of tiny ones - like rats. Hmm. This place is crawling with rats, but how do we coax them over to the giant?$B$BHey! You don\'t mind having your cellular matrix broken down and reassembled do you? It\'s only painful while it\'s happening. I can shrink you down to rat-sized and you can ride one of these brutes over there like a horse. It\'s so crazy it\'s got to work! Speak with me when you\'re ready for shrinkage...' WHERE `word_id` = 174195; -- locales_quest - details : entry=14388
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Okay, now we\'re in a real crisis, and you know what? I\'m MAD! No one tries to destroy MY resort! Especially not that little worm Dodd Finnert. I\'ve always disliked him, especially his stupid moustache!!!$B$BListen $N, we\'re going to try one last, crazy plan that should get rid of the Twilight cultists once and for all. The greater rocs that live in the mountains to the east have enormously fireproof qualities. We\'re going to fashion a fireproof bridle out of their guts. 12 should do it.' WHERE `word_id` = 189698; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29058
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Okay, we have got to get out of here before she blows for good!$B$BLet\'s head out the other end of the tunnel on the north side of the mine. We should be able to use one of the mine carts for a quick ride down the side of the volcano.' WHERE `word_id` = 176438; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25125
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Okay, yes, I have already been informed that bobcats are much smaller than I was assuming. But that\'s still pretty dangerous for gnomes! You\'ve done a good thing for the safety of this lodge, $N!' WHERE `word_id` = 183202; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27026
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Okay, you\'re all checked in. Wait here for Captain Krazz to bring the zeppelin around, then get on board and accompany the air fleet. Admiral Stonefist will be waiting for you outside of Dragonmaw Port!' WHERE `word_id` = 180945; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26388
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Okrilla sent you?  Okrilla the killa\'? Loramus was his name?  I\'m sorry to say that we have not seen your demon hunter... but we have ways of finding him.' WHERE `word_id` = 178314; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25683
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Ol\' Gunny doesn\'t have much longer...$B$BDo me one last favor, and kill the biggest, meanest fel orcs ye can find.$B$BFor old times\' sake, aye?' WHERE `word_id` = 191273; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29652
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Olakin should consider himself fortunate. No one is rescued from the Scourge, no one. No amount of thread and heroism will save him a second time. I\'ll make certain he remembers it.' WHERE `word_id` = 163093; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=13220
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Omusa Eulogized' WHERE `word_id` = 174992; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText4 : entry=24573
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='On a somewhat unrelated note, I\'ve been putting together a collection of troll stories and legends for a... personal project. I was just thinking you might be able to help me find some of them.$B$BThe Bloodscalps at the Bal\'lal ruins, on the coast to the southwest, maintain a large tablet documenting some of their stories. Of course, I\'ll reimburse you if you\'re able to bring any of these stories back to me.' WHERE `word_id` = 182198; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26744
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='On behalf of Desolace herself, I thank you, $R. Please accept our deepest gratitude.' WHERE `word_id` = 173891; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=14306
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='On behalf of the Cenarion Expedition druids of Evergrove, and the indigenous life of the Ruuan Weald, Tree Warden Chawn has asked you to slay Maxnar the Ashmaw. Return to him at Evergrove in the Blade\'s Edge Mountains after you have done so.' WHERE `word_id` = 152173; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=10748
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='On behalf of the people of Darkshire and as the Leader of the Night Watch, I thank you, $N, for your bravery and dedication. May the Light shine upon your ways.' WHERE `word_id` = 130365; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=58
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='On behalf of Thunder Bluff and its warriors, I welcome you, $N. Always fight honorably and bravely beneath our banner.' WHERE `word_id` = 164123; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=13694
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='On behalf of us all at Shadowprey Village, I thank you, $R.' WHERE `word_id` = 174015; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=14335
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='On the day when Leyara attacked Hamuul, she was waiting near some ruins in Hyjal, northwest of the Regrowth. She acted strangely at the time: calm, silent, and staring off into the distance. Perhaps that location is of some importance to her.$B$BThe locket might react if brought to that location.' WHERE `word_id` = 190715; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29310
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='On the Firelands\' largest island, our troops have been having trouble against Shannox, the flamewaker hunter. Not only does he have impeccable aim, but he keeps trained hounds that give our troops no end of trouble.$B$BTholo, in all his wisdom, thinks it would be a good idea to study the biology of these hounds. I, of course, agree with Tholo.$B$BYou will find several hounds in the Molten Flow, beneath the Furnace. We will need their ashes to study.' WHERE `word_id` = 190585; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29274
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='On the lowest level of the ruins, scout the northern end of the Quel\'Dormir Gardens, the passage that leads under the ruins west of the gardens, and the structures at the southeast corner of the ruins, below the bridges.' WHERE `word_id` = 177928; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=25582
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='ON THE OTHER... SIDE OF... MY CHAMBER THERE... ARE... CANDIDATES FOR ASCENSION.$B$BWE WILL NEED... THEIR... RUNESTONES OF BINDING... TO CREATE A... MEANS OF CONTROLLING... A BOUND ELEMENTAL.' WHERE `word_id` = 180040; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26141
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='On the western edge of the Pale Roost, you will find a resonating crystal. Strike it with the mallet and the broodmother will come.$B$BBe ready for battle. I will be there to aid you, but she will not be easily overcome.' WHERE `word_id` = 181878; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26659
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='On to other matters. I have a package that I need delivered.$B$BA young lady came by our town not long ago, looking for compressed blasting powder, a tempered mithril bomb casing, and some safety goggles. Naturally, we had plenty of blasting powder and bomb casings to sell her, but the safety goggles were a little harder to find.$B$BLong story short, I\'ve got the goggles, but she\'s already returned to her studies down in Lethlor Ravine. Will you bring these down to her?' WHERE `word_id` = 185677; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27764
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='On top of the barrel, you discover a map with some hastily written text on it, along with some coins.' WHERE `word_id` = 181696; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=26609
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Once again you have helped us to overcome our mutual enemy, the Alliance. Now it is time for us to help you.' WHERE `word_id` = 176331; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25098
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Once again you have proven your mettle. Had Harbinger Skyriss broken free, countless thousands would have perished in the ensuing conflict, just as happened with another servant of the Old Gods, Skeram, on your world of Azeroth.$B$B$N, what I have to offer in return may seem a pittance in comparison, but know that it comes with the everlasting gratitude of the Sha\'tar.' WHERE `word_id` = 152761; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10882
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Once again you have proven yourself to be all that was prophesied. You have the eternal gratitude of the high chief $N -- and these Stillpine relics to choose from...' WHERE `word_id` = 147868; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=9667
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Once again, $C, I cannot do this without your help. I will try to quiet this tempest, but you will need to fight back the unstable elementals that whirl around it. Only then can we free Go\'el!' WHERE `word_id` = 190733; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29328
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Once again, well done. With a few more pushes the battle will be ours.' WHERE `word_id` = 185988; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27843
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Once again, you have earned my respect, and the gratitude of the Stormwind Army. There may yet be kobolds in the mine, but I will marshal others against them. We have further tasks for you.' WHERE `word_id` = 130231; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=21
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Once again, you have my thanks, $N. Without you, I would not have been able to recover anything useful from this disaster.' WHERE `word_id` = 157618; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=11796
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Once again, you have produced items with the skill of a seasoned professional. You have earned this pattern, as well as my congratulations.' WHERE `word_id` = 137293; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=2858
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Once again, you prove your honor to us! I will make sure that your deeds are known amongst my kind.$B$BRemember to bring any of the Winterfall\'s beads you find to me. For each set you continue to bring to me, I will speak on your behalf to the tribe.' WHERE `word_id` = 143597; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28523
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Once again, you\'ve filled a complex order with the skill of a seasoned professional. You have earned this pattern, as well as my thanks.' WHERE `word_id` = 137265; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=2851
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Once free of the chain, Torth died rather than submit again. I admire the creature. I will have his hide fashioned into a set of armor. This much is clear to me now: The Dragonmaw cannot stand alone if the Alliance backs the Wildhammer. Narkrall proved that. And you have proven the might of the Horde, again and again. I will rebuild our drake wings and take up position outside the Bastion of Twilight. You should continue to help out here in the Gullet and elsewhere in the Highlands.' WHERE `word_id` = 187011; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28133
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Once it\'s complete, we\'re going to need to get this bomb down to Saurboz.$B$BAnd by \'we\', I mean \'you\'.$B$BWith so many of the enemy prowling about, I\'ll need to create something special if you\'re to have any chance of success.$B$BI can modify one of these busted shredders, but I\'ll need a few parts. You should have no trouble finding them in the woods to the west.$B$BRound them up while I finish work on the bomb.' WHERE `word_id` = 173000; -- locales_quest - details : entry=13983
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Once Melisara is through with you we will detonate the explosives!' WHERE `word_id` = 188570; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28556
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Once more you have secured the present and the future of this world, $N. Please accept these items as reward for your accomplishments.' WHERE `word_id` = 150503; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10298
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Once the growth starts, it is near impossible to stomp back into submission. Through persistence our realm will one day be cleansed.' WHERE `word_id` = 183291; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27049
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Once those Reliquary honks got here, we panicked, and we all just started looting indiscriminately.$B$BA lot of bad archaeology happened that day.$B$BLuckily, Olga happened upon this small jade statue. We thought it to be a key of some sort, but can\'t figure out what it opens. Maybe you\'ll have some better luck with it.' WHERE `word_id` = 185811; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27796
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Once we deal with the rest of the undead we will confront Stillwater!' WHERE `word_id` = 187439; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28230
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Once we flush the central reactor, I need you to return the core to me. It\'s 100%refined azsharite crystal, which is both powerful and dangerous. And lovely. Oh precious azsharite, the shaper of worlds to come!$B$BThe giant lever to your left will dump the core and send it to me via the rail system. The core will be superheated, so you\'ll need to periodically douse it with the Fireliminator on the way here... don\'t let it reach critical temperature!' WHERE `word_id` = 173911; -- locales_quest - details : entry=14310
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Once, a long time ago, a brother of mine took some meat from one of Lar\'korwi\'s kills. He didn\'t know it at the time, but Lar\'korwi saw him from the forest. Lar\'korwi followed my brother for days, destroying everything he touched. My brother, scared, finally decided to run from the Crater and leave Lar\'korwi behind.$B$BLar\'korwi killed him not far from this spot.$B$BIf you want to provoke Lar\'korwi, find a fresh kill of his and take some of the meat from it.$B$BStart your search to the west.' WHERE `word_id` = 175382; -- locales_quest - details : entry=24731
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One by one, my brother\'s servants have fallen. Loken\'s insurrection will soon come to an end.' WHERE `word_id` = 162267; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=13035
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One by one, we\'re gonna have to pull our siege tanks outta the muck. Take these \'ere spare parts you\'ve collected and give \'em to a siege tank commander who\'s standing on top of a gimped-up machine.$B$BThen defend the tank while engineers de-gimpify it.$B$BGo an\' make me proud, $C!' WHERE `word_id` = 184575; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27468
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One can barely keep their eyes from leaving its splendor, $N. Aye, citrine is a glorious gem.$B$BPay attention and learn what such a discovery may teach us!' WHERE `word_id` = 137142; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=2763
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One day I will grow up to be a real breadcrumb! To Feralas!!!!1' WHERE `word_id` = 174294; -- locales_quest - details : entry=14411
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One day, $N, you will be able to use this orb to communicate directly with me. Whenever this battle with Hakkar be over and Maywiki go home. Let us call to the spirits and ask them for that day to come soon.' WHERE `word_id` = 142942; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=8119
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One hundred years ago...$B$BI and a small group of other High Elves traveled here from our homeland, Quel\'thalas. We sought the ancient mysteries of Kel\'thoril... to find why it was destroyed.$B$BWe found fragments in the ice, shards of the crystal. The Archmage we accompanied did not take long to fall under their sway. In our foolishness, we noticed too late.$B$BHis spirit wanders in the southeast, among those he drove to madness, still clutching the memory of the precious shard...' WHERE `word_id` = 188431; -- locales_quest - details : entry=28518
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One last thing, $G hunter: huntress;. You\'ll want to speak with Apolos at the Undercity. He\'ll teach you the last few bits of knowledge necessary to care for and train your pet.$B$BYou can find him in the War Quarter.' WHERE `word_id` = 176281; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25083
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One less dragon to worry about, one step closer to redemption. Onward, my soldiers!' WHERE `word_id` = 185931; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27829
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One less plague cauldron to account for when the battle commences.$B$BYour captain will be highly pleased.' WHERE `word_id` = 163424; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=13297
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One less plague cauldron to account for when the battle commences.$B$BYour commander will be pleased.' WHERE `word_id` = 163362; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=13281
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One less thing to worry about. Nice work up there.' WHERE `word_id` = 185119; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27616
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One o\' the gnomish engineerin\' trainers gave me a blueprint fer a fancy lure he says\'ll help me catch fish faster and keep \'em from gettin\' away. The whole thing sounds a mite silly if ye ask me, but I\'ll try anythin\' once.$B$BHere are the blueprints. Ye\'re going to need shiny baubles, which ye can buy from my assistant inside the buildin\', a hair trigger ye can buy from an engineerin\' supplier in Tinker Town, and a few rat traps from the Deeprun Tram.' WHERE `word_id` = 190305; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29350
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of a fisher\'s most simple and effective tools is the shiny bauble; affixed to a line, even the most novice angler has a chance at a catch.$B$BWith all the fishing going on of late, though, Thunder Bluff is in woefully short supply!$B$BMight I ask you to collect shiny stones from around the base of the central rise? Bring them to Nahari Cloudchaser so that she might craft more shiny baubles with them.' WHERE `word_id` = 190325; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29354
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of Clay\'s catapult teams is broken down on the front. I need you to get some parts from him and get that catapult back in the fight, $N.' WHERE `word_id` = 181751; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26626
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of Kel\'Thuzad\'s most trusted students oversees the operations in Scholomance. You must confront the lich, Ras Frostwhisper, in his lair. The door to his chamber is adjacent to the viewing room.$B$BDestroy him, $N. Leave no trace of his existence so that he may never again bring such horrors into our world.' WHERE `word_id` = 183616; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27142
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of my children is not with me, $N.$B$BHe stayed behind with the Twilight\'s Hammer at the Stonecore deep within the Temple of Earth.$B$BI sent my other children to free him from the dark magic that was surely keeping him from returning here, but... no such magic was placed upon him.$B$BGo into the Stonecore and destroy Ozruk. He must be reclaimed by the earth.' WHERE `word_id` = 189317; -- locales_quest - details : entry=28824
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of my friends says that a steam tank mechanic in Westfall lets visitors use his choppers. My friend even got to ride one!$B$BI\'ve seen people ride by the orphanage in choppers. They\'re real loud and just about the fastest thing I\'ve ever seen! I want to try one out!$B$BCould we go to Sentinel Hill in Westfall and ride one of those choppers? Please? I promise to behave myself and we could see the crazy giant hole left when the world changed!' WHERE `word_id` = 189761; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29093
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of my responsibilities is to feed the sentinels of Darnassus while they\'re on duty. It\'s a time-consuming task, but one I\'m happy to undertake. It\'s also a great way to practice your skills. Would you mind helping me with today\'s meal? Simply take these ribs, cook them near a stove or fire, and distribute them to sentinels throughout the city.' WHERE `word_id` = 190209; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29318
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of our civilian leaders was taken prisoner by the air elementals.$B$BThey are probably torturing him for information as we speak.$B$BGo to the Vortex Pinnacle, where these foul creatures came from, and look for Itesh.$B$BYou will find the entrance to the Vortex Pinnacle hovering off of the southeastern coast of Uldum.' WHERE `word_id` = 189395; -- locales_quest - details : entry=28845
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of our druids moved ahead into the Igneous Depths in pursuit of a Druid of the Flame.$B$BGo to her. Help her.' WHERE `word_id` = 190444; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29209
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of our greatest struggles is obtaining the natural resources we need to survive. Gold was scarce in Lordaeron, even in the height of the Alliance\'s power so many years ago.$B$BThere is a gold mine to the west that has been overrun with spiders. We need gold from the mine, but we can\'t very well get it while the spiders are crawling around in there. I\'ve not much manpower to commit to the task, so we\'ll just have to do it little by little.$B$BGet up there and see what you can do for us, $N.' WHERE `word_id` = 175860; -- locales_quest - details : entry=24973
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of our more useful shaman, Margoz, knows more of the Burning Blade\'s corruption. He speaks of a cave called Skull Rock in the mountains, just outside Orgrimmar, that shelters a large band of Burning Blade cultists.$B$BBefore you go to Skull Rock, speak with Margoz. He is wise and his council is valued.$B$BHe is camped to the southeast, between the coast and Drygulch Ravine.$B$BFollow his advice, but whatever Margoz says, $N, I still want you to crush those cultists!' WHERE `word_id` = 176912; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25261
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of our scouts brought back unpleasant news. We\'ve spotted a powerful agent of the Burning Legion in the ramparts!$B$BI need you to kill this demon before he has a chance to relay news of our efforts to his superiors.' WHERE `word_id` = 191087; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29530
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of our scouts spotted what he thought was an agent of the Burning Legion somewhere in the ramparts. If that is true, then Honor Hold may be in grave danger of a combined assault!$B$BIf you find this fiend in there, kill it on sight.' WHERE `word_id` = 191083; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29529
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of Ragnaros\' Lieutenants has shown himself at Ragnaros\' Reach, the walled area to our northeast.$B$BI hoped to send you as soon as you returned, but I suspect Witherbranch and some of our forces have already joined the fight by now. You should hurry.$B$BYou should be able to drop down the cliff wall right here and reach them quickly.' WHERE `word_id` = 190701; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29305
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of Ragnaros\' Lieutenants has shown itself at Ragnaros\' Reach. It is time to strike. Captain Saynna has requested that you be there to help see the fight through.$B$BWitherbranch and some others will have joined the battle by the time you arrive. You should make haste to the northwest and find them.' WHERE `word_id` = 190492; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29243
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of ssseveral complete...' WHERE `word_id` = 141477; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=6582
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of the \'projects\' underway here is the plagued dragonflight. Thankfully, they\'re only hatchlings right now, but if we wait much longer they will become one of the scourge\'s most powerful weapons and a major threat to all of Azeroth, especially my family\'s land!$B$BSlay ten of their whelps and be sure to take care of Rattlegore as well. He is in the small space beneath where the whelps are housed and prepares supplements to catalyze their growth. Hurry...before they get any bigger!' WHERE `word_id` = 183625; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27145
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of the biggest dangers that our druids face when fighting within the Firelands is simple dehydration. Our proveditors spend a significant amount of time preparing canteens for the troops on the other side. We do have other methods, however.$B$BIn the greener thickets to the east, you should still find some blueroot vines which have not yet burned. These plants hold a tremendous amount of water in their roots - and also provide some energy for the weary soldier.' WHERE `word_id` = 190041; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29166
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of the Earthen Ring, Wavespeaker Valoren, swam down into the Nightmare Depths to the northeast. We haven\'t heard from her in awhile.$B$BSwim out there and see if you can find her.' WHERE `word_id` = 179720; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26056
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of the few items of worth that we managed to loot from these ruins is this small jade statue.$B$BWe believe it to be a key of some sort, but we\'re unable to determine what it opens. As such, it is useless to me.$B$BPerhaps you\'ll have some better luck with it.' WHERE `word_id` = 186120; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27883
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of the first lessons you should learn, $N, is to never underestimate your prey.$B$BWhile we were distracted by the attack on Camp Narache, more of the Bristleback swept in unnoticed and stole a cache of our rifles. You can see them to the south now, filling the air with lead.$B$BThis is your Rite of Courage: brave the hail of gunfire, hunt the Bristleback gun thieves, and bring back our rifles.' WHERE `word_id` = 174405; -- locales_quest - details : entry=14456
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of the fleeing Drakkari trolls told me of a great raptor king, Dred, that was immune to the plague.$B$BIf you could find King Dred and bring me one of his teeth, perhaps I could fashion it into a weapon.' WHERE `word_id` = 191410; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29828
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of the Forsaken from the Pools of Vision came to me and said he\'d lost his ring to a blind cavefish in the waters there.$B$BOr perhaps it was his finger. It was hard to tell; his jaw did not move and his Orcish was no better than mine.$B$BIn any case, I thought it would be a kind gesture towards our unusual visitors to catch and gut cavefish until the ring - or finger - was found.$B$BWould you help?' WHERE `word_id` = 190284; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29346
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of the great delicacies of Mulgore is the crayfish that dwell in our lakes and streams. They are particularly popular during weddings or the celebration of a birth.$B$BWould you help me catch some of these crafty crustaceans for the cooking pots of Thunder Bluff?$B$BYou can fish them up from Stonebull Lake, or simply dive in and grab them.' WHERE `word_id` = 190300; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29349
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of the infamous Grimtotem leaders of the Stonetalon Mountains has returned home.$B$BWe should take this opportunity to make sure that he doesn\'t go anywhere else.' WHERE `word_id` = 184097; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27323
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of the key fortifications within Tyr\'s Hand is the barracks, which lies right next to this flare. The Brotherhood of Light and their centurions will need all the help they can get in sacking it.' WHERE `word_id` = 184547; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27462
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of the more vile members of the Scarlet Crusade, Mataus the Wrathcaster, lurks within the barracks\' dungeon. Undeath suits his dark manner.$B$BWere I younger and on the front lines, I\'d run him through myself. As things are, I\'m left behind to lead our forces from the rear. So I leave the pleasure to you.' WHERE `word_id` = 185113; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27615
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of the most accomplished Grimtotem leaders of the Stonetalon Mountains has returned home.$B$BWe must make the most of this chance and put an end to his campaign of terror once and for all.' WHERE `word_id` = 184100; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27324
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of the native species in Kalimdor is the \'quilboar.\' Prickly little buggers. Reason enough to hate this continent.$B$BThe raids started shortly after we established our forward camps. Worse, those spiny fiends seem to thrive in this thorny hell of a jungle. I need you to help beat them back so we can re-establish contact with Forward Command.$B$BWhile you\'re out there, acquire one of those twisted branches their casters seem to be using to manipulate the jungle growth...' WHERE `word_id` = 176016; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25015
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of the things I hate the most about digging is the fact that half the time, all you find is dirt. That\'s why I\'ve been spending most of my time out here tinkering instead of digging.$B$BLet me show you what I\'ve invented: the Fossil-Finder 3000. I just put the finishing touches on it. If it works properly, it should find the largest fossils in the area. I know, sweet, huh?$B$BTest it out and see if you can find some ridiculously big dinosaur bones.' WHERE `word_id` = 175338; -- locales_quest - details : entry=24708
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of the things that makes a rogue dangerous is our ability to use combinations of combat maneuvers and wait for the chance to use a devastating technique.$B$BNow that you\'ve had a chance to master Sinister Strike, it\'s time to show you a new skill you can use as a follow up.$B$BPlease, allow me to train you.' WHERE `word_id` = 174900; -- locales_quest - details : entry=24532
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of the Vale\'s many treasures lies nearby, on OUR side of the giant whirlpool. The Mind\'s Eye is held by an ogre mage, in the Mosh\'Ogg ogre mound just to the northeast. His name is Mai\'Zoth. From what I understand, he is vicious, and his magic is strong.$B$BAnd if he has the Mind\'s Eye, then his magic will be stronger still.$B$BThus far I\'ve been unable to get near enough to take it from him. Will you give it a try?' WHERE `word_id` = 182310; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26781
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of those mangy fleabags got Dempsey real good. We cannot move him until we stabilize his bleeding.$B$BGive us a hand holding back these mongrels. A couple of minutes is all we need, $Gbrother:sister;!' WHERE `word_id` = 173410; -- locales_quest - details : entry=14154
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of Thunder Bluff\'s most important staples is cornmeal; bowls of corn may be found in nearly every home.$B$BWith so many of the local mills under constant attack by harpies, gnolls, reckless mining companies and Earth Mother knows what else, I often ask my students to help with the task of grinding corn into cornmeal.$B$BWould you care to help?' WHERE `word_id` = 190374; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29364
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One of your responsibilities as a priest is caring for the wounded. With the power of the Light, you can save those who would otherwise die and speed the healing of wounds.$B$BI want to teach you a simple, quick technique you can use to heal an ally quickly.$B$B I\'ll show you how it\'s done, and then I want you to use this spell to treat the injuries of wounded trainees around the abbey.' WHERE `word_id` = 182769; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26919
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One other thing I need. Hot water.$B$BNot easy around here. Not hot springs, no friends to share. One good way though. Have this sponge... it\'s ultra absorbent! Use it to go soak Vile Splashes at the sandbar eastish.$B$BWith enough, go squeeze them out over near the tower to summon jumbo elemental. He has hot water.' WHERE `word_id` = 173963; -- locales_quest - details : entry=14323
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One page!  I only need one more page!$B$BMaster Nesingwary\'s novel ran into a bit of an... accident <Barnil shoots an accusing glance over at Spanks>... and we misplaced some of the pages.$B$BI\'ve been asking your fellow adventurers to look for the missing pages, and they\'ve been quite helpful, but one page still eludes me.$B$BI\'m sure you\'re awfully busy with other matters, but while you\'re out in the jungle, would you mind looking for it?' WHERE `word_id` = 180488; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26269
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One thing about me that you might not know, $N...$B$BI come from a long line of trappers. My father taught me, as his taught him, to master the art of trapping creatures in a most merciful manner.$B$BAs any master trapper will tell you, the most important ingredient in an effective trap is the bait.$B$BSo let\'s start there.$B$BFill this bucket with the meat scraps from almost any wild creature in Uldum.' WHERE `word_id` = 187919; -- locales_quest - details : entry=28350
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One thing you should always remember is that you gotta respect the world you\'re livin\' in. The beasts that choose to fight along side you; the shine of your weapon; the weight of your ammo; the bite of a bitter wind; all these things you need to know intimately.$B$BI\'ll do what I can to help you, but most of the work\'s up to you. Anytime you think you\'re ready, come back and talk to me. I\'ll train you when I can.' WHERE `word_id` = 137838; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=3108
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One way or another, Loken shall fall.$B$BThe honor and glory of his defeat shall be yours.$B$BReturn to me with his lying tongue, and earn my unending gratitude.' WHERE `word_id` = 191464; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29861
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One With the Ground ritual complete' WHERE `word_id` = 186288; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=27934
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One year ago, my mother - that is, the troll who took care of me - was taken by the Skullsplitters of Zul\'Mamwe. Young and headstrong, I ran in after her, only to see her being pushed toward a burning brazier by a dozen of their warriors. I hid behind a tree and watched as they grabbed her and... and...$B$B<Kil\'karil looks away.>$B$BAt nighttime, the lights from their braziers reflect off the treetops and keep me awake. Please, $N... travel south into Zul\'Mamwe and put them out.' WHERE `word_id` = 180610; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26304
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One year ago...$B$BThe legend of the Crystal of Zin-Malor reached Silvermoon, and I led a group of the finest warriors and scholars available to this land. We brought ample mana crystals, so none of us would be tempted to taste the crystal itself.$B$BThe crystal did not need our hunger to ruin us. Once in our possession, it warped all but me into wretched beasts.$B$BThe wretched souls still wander, seeking more lives to chain to this lake. Will you give them mercy... or flee to die on safer ground someday?' WHERE `word_id` = 188436; -- locales_quest - details : entry=28519
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='One, two, three,... hehe, that be a good number o\' them, mon! Now we be safe for quite some time!' WHERE `word_id` = 163889; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=13556
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Ongo\'longo Enraged' WHERE `word_id` = 180862; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=26367
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Ongo\'longo was one of us. What outsiders called a Dire Troll, but he was a Revantusk, and a proud warrior like all of us!$B$BThen the Vilebranch took him. They keep him chained up in a pit at the top of Jintha\'Alor, made to dance for their sick amusement.$B$BNo chains can hold Ongo\'longo. All you need to do is raise his temper, $N. Fight him until he\'s enraged enough to remember his true spirit and break free... and then get out of the way!' WHERE `word_id` = 180859; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26367
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Only a veteran like you could brave the dangers lurking here.' WHERE `word_id` = 182736; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=26908
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Only air remains, $N.' WHERE `word_id` = 151193; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10480
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Only once has there been a leader capable of commanding demigods and mortals alike.$B$BHis name was Jarod Shadowsong and his ability to lead in battle was such that Cenarius and the other Ancients placed themselves under his command.$B$BHe disappeared for years and his whereabouts were unknown. Until now.$B$BHe is being held captive inside a Twilight camp in Darkwhisper Gorge.$B$BYour job is to infiltrate their ranks and free Jarod. Speak to the one known as Ortell at Darkwhisper Pass to the southeast.' WHERE `word_id` = 177985; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25597
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Only one final power remains lurking in the depths of Shadow Hold now: Lord Banehollow.$B$BThe Shadow Council here serves his whims, and even Fel\'dan was a mere instrument for him to prepare this land for another invasion of the Burning Legion.$B$BProceed carefully, $N. A dreadlord is a terrifying foe. Stand tall and triumph!' WHERE `word_id` = 187109; -- locales_quest - details : entry=28155
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Only one may enter? I know just the person for this mission. I will prepare our forces and have them at the ready.' WHERE `word_id` = 184644; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27484
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Only one piece of the World Pillar remains, and it is in the hands of the Stonemother herself. Worse, the temple has come under siege by elementals and giants. It\'s not a terrible leap of logic to assume they\'re acting by her will.$B$BGo out and meet the elementals in battle to the northwest. Work with Torunscar and Norsala to find a way to communicate with their leaders and seek out the World Pillar. We would prefer such be done peacefully, but we will do whatever we must to seal the rift.' WHERE `word_id` = 180710; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26326
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Only partly useless then. Good work.' WHERE `word_id` = 163473; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=13310
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Only Razzeric would take a look at this and say that I\'d somehow put some sort of safety lock on it. This booster is almost completely seaforium explosives. I already modified it so that more of its payload would be delivered upon use, but Razzeric is never content unless he goes to eleven!' WHERE `word_id` = 135089; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=1188
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Only the Blackrock high command remains, $N. They\'re all holed up in Stonewatch Keep, directly south of our position here at Keeshan\'s Post. I want you and the rest of Bravo Company to enter Stonewatch and put an end to the Blackrock orc invasion.$B$B$N, no survivors.' WHERE `word_id` = 182074; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26713
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Only the strongest and foulest Vilebranch are left now. The soul eaters and blood drinkers, foul worshippers of the evil god Hakkar.$B$BDon\'t forget you\'re not just fighting trolls here, $N. You\'re fighting dark and evil forces that\'ll churn this land into ash if we let them live!$B$BShow no mercy!' WHERE `word_id` = 181342; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26516
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Only the strongest and foulest Vilebranch are left now. The soul eaters and blood drinkers, foul worshippers of the evil god Hakkar.$B$BThey are FOOLS! They cling to old, defeated beliefs. I won\'t tolerate their crimes against the Revantusk any longer.$B$BStrike the final blow. Claim Jintha\'Alor for the Revantusk... claim it for the Horde!' WHERE `word_id` = 180625; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26308
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Only with all three united may I divine the secrets you so desperately seek!' WHERE `word_id` = 151802; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10636
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Onslaught Gryphon delivered to Uzo Deathcaller' WHERE `word_id` = 161326; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=12814
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Onslaught Raven Priest\'s image stolen' WHERE `word_id` = 159239; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=12260
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Ooh!  Science stuff!  Let\'s see what you\'ve got here...$B$BWild eggs?  Blech. Useless. These are never any good.$B$BOoooh, what\'s this?  Some sort of... pre-engineered egg?  This looks promising, but I don\'t want to know what Rhea had to do to get it.$B$BHmm... yes, some very nice corpses. Very nice indeed.$B$BAlright, I\'ll see what I can do.' WHERE `word_id` = 185711; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27772
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Ooh, by the looks of those, they\'re fine specimens. I can\'t wait to get my examination tools unpacked and have a real look at them!$B$BThank you!' WHERE `word_id` = 151294; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10510
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Ooh, etherlithium matrix crystals. Yeah, those sound important!$B$BLet\'s just put them over here and I\'ll get to figuring them out in a moment.' WHERE `word_id` = 150157; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10225
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Ooh, these are nice. Now, leave me alone with my gizzards. I\'ve got studying to do! Yes, very interesting. Very interesting indeed...' WHERE `word_id` = 186646; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28032
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Ooh, ya dats da stuff, mon!' WHERE `word_id` = 162998; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=13192
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oohh look! A mostly complete exhaust manifold, a reciprocating junction box, a working counterweight slip differential ... you sure know your junk, $N.' WHERE `word_id` = 176252; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25075
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oomlot Warriors defeated' WHERE `word_id` = 175580; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=24901
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Ooo, that bread smells delicious. You are quite the baker, $N.$B$BWho knows how far these exquisite loaves will go... I hear it\'s even popular among the draenei of the Azuremyst Isles!' WHERE `word_id` = 190371; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=29363
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Ooooo-oooh aye! The best Hecklefangs are the dead ones.' WHERE `word_id` = 175990; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25008
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oops. Well, what goes up must eventually come down.' WHERE `word_id` = 176769; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25214
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oozes Dissolved' WHERE `word_id` = 153942; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=11174
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Opalescent Guardians Escorted to safety' WHERE `word_id` = 181867; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText2 : entry=26656
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Open 4 Quilboar Cages.' WHERE `word_id` = 175509; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=24852
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Open portal within Hall of Arms' WHERE `word_id` = 185102; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=27612
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Open portal within Library Wing' WHERE `word_id` = 185103; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText2 : entry=27612
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Open Sharpbeak\'s Cage' WHERE `word_id` = 137684; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText2 : entry=2994
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Open the Antediluvian Chest.' WHERE `word_id` = 337734; -- locales_quest - completedText : entry=25070
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Open the Argent Portals in the Library Wing and the Hall of Arms within the abbey in Tyr\'s Hand.' WHERE `word_id` = 185100; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=27612
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Open the Horde Treasure Chest.' WHERE `word_id` = 337735; -- locales_quest - completedText : entry=25377
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Open the Mosh\'Ogg Bounty by fighting a Venture Co. Shredder or by using the sawblade in the Venture Company lumber mill.' WHERE `word_id` = 180992; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=26400
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Open the pages of the Lashh\'an Tome at Veil Lashh in the Blade\'s Edge Mountains.' WHERE `word_id` = 337736; -- locales_quest - completedText : entry=10555
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Open the portal to the Firelands' WHERE `word_id` = 190392; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=29195
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Opening the chest reveals a blackened orb, pulsing with an eerie light. This must be the foul Eye of Paleth that damned these sailors\' souls.$B$BSuch corruption should be purged. Perhaps a priest in Menethil Harbor could help you.' WHERE `word_id` = 178828; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25819
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Opening the hatch, you find an imposing looking mechanical device hooked to several wires, gears, and who knows what else.$B$BIt\'s easily detached. Time to bring it back to Bingles.' WHERE `word_id` = 183230; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27033
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Opening the magically suspended tome, a sense of dread overwhelms you.$B$BSomething is most definitely wrong here!$B$BYou read on, but what you read seems unbelievable!' WHERE `word_id` = 149614; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10094
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Opening the magically-suspended tome, a sense of dread overwhelms you.$B$BSomething is most definitely wrong here!' WHERE `word_id` = 191253; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=29643
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Opening the strongbox, it\'s clear that this is where Herod keeps his more valuable coins and items.' WHERE `word_id` = 131527; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=328
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Or\'Kalar leads the ogres here. He has evaded slaughter for years. His very presence is an affront to the Dark Lady; Mug\'thol, traitor to the Forsaken, commands him from afar!$B$BWe do not suffer ogres or traitors on Forsaken land. Bring me this ogre\'s head and I will make sure it\'s burned properly this time.' WHERE `word_id` = 179649; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26029
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Orb placed in abomination lab' WHERE `word_id` = 162646; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=13120
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Orb placed in flesh giant lab' WHERE `word_id` = 162647; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText2 : entry=13120
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Orb used beneath Vordrassil\'s Heart' WHERE `word_id` = 159053; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=12213
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Orb used beneath Vordrassil\'s Limb' WHERE `word_id` = 159054; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText2 : entry=12213
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Orc Sea Dog rescued' WHERE `word_id` = 183463; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=27093
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Orc Sea Dog roused' WHERE `word_id` = 183863; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=27226
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Orcs?! They were sunk and stranded too?  And now the Alliance are on the island? Do you think they\'re going to kill us? I think it\'s time for a little sitdown with these orcs.' WHERE `word_id` = 173602; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=14233
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Orders! Let\'s see what we have here... hah! He wants me to deal with the infestation of rat men. We\'re already in the middle of that, so no real deviation there. Care to lend a hand?' WHERE `word_id` = 172403; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=13636
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Ordinn sent you with these?$B$B<The smith examines the ingots.>$B$BHe was right. Most of the magic is gone, but I can still sense traces of it. With some work and a few \'exotic\' resources, I can forge you a powerful anti-demon sword from this metal.' WHERE `word_id` = 151900; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10662
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Ore Cart released' WHERE `word_id` = 157797; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=11904
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Ore from Farshire?  We weren\'t scheduled for a shipment just yet. Is something wrong?' WHERE `word_id` = 157983; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=11962
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Ore Heap dissolved' WHERE `word_id` = 178289; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=25677
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Orfus is a good tuskarr - one of our strongest warriors. I knew he would not let us down.$B$BAllow me to see what it is that you have brought.' WHERE `word_id` = 335675; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=11507
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Orgrimmar Auction House searched' WHERE `word_id` = 165367; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText2 : entry=24851
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Orgrimmar Bank searched' WHERE `word_id` = 165366; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=24851
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Orgrimmar Citizens searched' WHERE `word_id` = 171988; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=27801
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Orgrimmar\'s Ragefire Chasm has been taken by the Searing Blade. $N, we cannot allow this to pass unpunished, lest they next set their sights on Thunder Bluff.$B$BGo speak with Stone Guard Kurjack just inside the Chasm. Help him in any way you can, for our fates are intertwined.' WHERE `word_id` = 182605; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26866
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Orgus tested' WHERE `word_id` = 181394; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText2 : entry=26534
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oric the Baleful\'s Corpse Impaled' WHERE `word_id` = 156181; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=11282
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Orkus Safely Escorted Out of the Water' WHERE `word_id` = 187903; -- locales_quest - EndText : entry=28345
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Ornolf\'s crew will want to avenge their leader, but without him, they will be easier to defeat. We must live to carry out our mission, to see Icecrown rid of the Scourge and other evils.' WHERE `word_id` = 164737; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=14104
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Orsis Survivor rescued' WHERE `word_id` = 184798; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=27519
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Orsis!  Of course! How could I not have seen this?' WHERE `word_id` = 187015; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28134
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Orsonn\'s Story' WHERE `word_id` = 159103; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=12231
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Orthus is dead. He is clutching something in his hand.' WHERE `word_id` = 179889; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=26097
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oskar\'s alive?  Wait... what did ya say?  Ya let him FLOAT AWAY AGAIN?! Well... ya held up your end of the bargain, and I appreciate everything ya\'ve done, $N. Here... take this. I\'ve only been hanging onto it as ballast, but it doesn\'t seem to be doing much good.' WHERE `word_id` = 179622; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=26021
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oskar\'s last wish, before he floated up into that great-eel\'s gullet, was to bring back food for the captain, so that\'s what we\'ll do.$B$BMy brother had a genius plan. He saw those murlocs luring fish out of the reeds with a phosphorescent antenna, and devised a way to make one of his own. All ya need is something that glows.$B$BKill the crabs and groupers that roam the canyon\'s floor. They aren\'t edible themselves, but their phosphora is far more valuable than their meat.' WHERE `word_id` = 179594; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26015
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Other goblin\'s minds freed' WHERE `word_id` = 176428; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText4 : entry=25122
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Other librams are lost in this world. Lost in places you would not dare enter. Places you would pray did not exist.$B$BI will drink in the energies of these components. You shall be given the residual waste...' WHERE `word_id` = 139137; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=4483
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Other than what you\'ve seen, the Portal\'s been surprisingly quiet. There isn\'t much more work I can give to you, I\'m afraid.$B$BIf you\'re looking for trouble, you might try the Gilnean fishing village to the southwest. Surwich, I think it was.$B$BI know we\'re supposed to be friends with the Gilneans, but really?  Worgen?  I had enough trouble getting used to the draenei.' WHERE `word_id` = 180146; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26175
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Other things you\'ll probably see too, just so yer in the know: dwarves usin\' magic in a fight \'stead of a rifle. Some of us takin\' to worshippin\' the Holy Light like some of the humans, and, last but not least, troggs. You\'ll learn more \'bout them later, but What you need to know now is that I\'m here to help ya.$B$BI be here to teach ya how to be a real $C. Anytime ya think ya need more trainin\', come back to me and I\'ll see what I can do.' WHERE `word_id` = 137830; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=3106
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our $G hero : heroine; returns!$B$BYou have saved my people, $N. You have earned that which you seek.' WHERE `word_id` = 186297; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27937
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our agreement remains in place. Just remember, this is but a taste of what awaits you. Free me of this cursed fate and I will reward you with items of truly great power.' WHERE `word_id` = 144583; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10495
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our alliance with the Dragonmaw is secured, but this port is far from combat ready. These flimsy wooden walls are an embarrassment to the Warchief.$B$BWhen water elementals carve their way through rock, as they have in the Verrall River, they create a peculiar kind of muck. It spreads easily and dries harder than the hardest stone. It\'s the perfect mortar for large-scale construction.$B$BGo to the river delta northwest of here and collect some Verrall River muck. Even a little will go a long way.' WHERE `word_id` = 182336; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26788
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our allies have come to our aid? Thank Elune. Tyrande was wise to extend open arms to your people. We need help. We need everyone we can get.' WHERE `word_id` = 180936; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=26385
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our ancestors lived alongside the Blackwood furbolgs for generations. But recently, we have lost contact with their settlements deeper in the forest. One of their larger villages, Blackwood Hold, can be found to the south.$B$BTravel there and find Elder Brolg. Ask him why his people have withdrawn from us and offer your help, if necessary.' WHERE `word_id` = 172078; -- locales_quest - details : entry=13525
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our armies clash across the battlefield. Crowley and his forces are losing ground and they do not yet know the fate of Lorna Crowley. We will meet with Crowley and his compatriots at mid field and I will present them with terms of their surrender. They will either accept or we will kill them all and leave their cities in dust.$B$BAs my most trusted soldier, you are to stand by my side during the exchange. Tell me when you are prepared to leave.' WHERE `word_id` = 185063; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27601
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our army needs water, and luckily the elements gave us plenty of that when the Cataclysm hit. The water that filled up the canyon to the southwest should do the trick.$B$BUnfortunately, the corpses of thunder lizards still sit at the bottom of the canyon, and their electrical discharges are a bit too dangerous. I\'ve got grunts that can lift them out of the water, but we need someone agile enough to attach the other end of the rope. Are you my $G man: woman;, $N?' WHERE `word_id` = 176850; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25236
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our artifact records! I was pretty well worried what the dark irons might try to steal with this information at their disposal. Thank you for bringing this back to us. We\'ll gladly part with some coin to express our gratitude.' WHERE `word_id` = 172480; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=13660
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our beliefs differ but our cause is righteous. Strike down our foes, noble $C.' WHERE `word_id` = 142745; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=8047
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our best demo-man, Ticker, is on assignment with the Gob Squad. He\'s got WAY more than enough explosives for all the runestones in the ruins.$B$BAll you have to do is get him there and keep him covered - he\'ll handle the rest.' WHERE `word_id` = 174515; -- locales_quest - details : entry=14485
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our best fighters are ready, we\'ve got the idol assembled... it\'s time, $N.$B$BHere\'s what we\'re gonna do. You\'ll travel southwest to Shadra\'Alor ahead of us with the idol. You\'ll need to use the idol at each of the three temples, fighting through the trolls guardin\' them.$B$BWhen you do that, Shadra will emerge into our world, and we\'ll be right there waiting for her with fury in our hearts. Talk to my boys on the scene as soon as you\'ve performed the ritual!' WHERE `word_id` = 181377; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26531
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our biggest enemy in the region is finally dead. You\'ve done the expedition a great favor, $N.$B$BWe shall be forever in your debt.' WHERE `word_id` = 148266; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=9763
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our blood elven allies have been examining the ruins marked on this map, and can likely understand this mysterious script. Seek out the one called Malynea Skyreaver. She conducts her research from the Orgrimmar Rocketway Exchange just north of here - it\'s part of the new goblin transit system that snakes across this land. Quickly, now!' WHERE `word_id` = 173360; -- locales_quest - details : entry=14128
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our bombs and tools! Those sneaky monkeys to the east stole them all in the dead of night!$B$BCan you go out there and get them back for us, $N? Without those tools, we have absolutely no way to get off of this island!' WHERE `word_id` = 173118; -- locales_quest - details : entry=14014
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our carriage drivers were told to regroup in the fishing town of Stormglen. Our scouts report there might be shelter and supplies to be found there.$B$BMeet Gwen Armstead there, she\'ll be in charge of taking care of our people.' WHERE `word_id` = 174738; -- locales_quest - details : entry=24483
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our clan reveres the gryphon as a sacred animal. They\'re majestic creatures of the skies, and more than just beasts; they\'re intelligent and cunning.$B$BSome say we keep them, but it\'s more of a friendship. If you want to befriend the Wildhammer here, first befriend our gryphons! Take this bag o\' chow, it\'s nice and fresh. Our trained razorbeak gryphons wander the forests to the south of the aviary. Go on and feed a few of \'em for me, aye?' WHERE `word_id` = 181445; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26546
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our cousins, the dwarves of Ironforge, have agreed to help us in the battle against Razlo Crushcog. Mountaineer Stonegrind is a veteran who knows Dun Morogh well. He and High Tinker Mekkatorque stand ready on a small snow-covered island in Iceflow Lake to the north. Meet up with them there and let the high tinker know when you are ready to face the traitor Crushcog.$B$BTake this orbital targeting device and use it during the battle. It will help guide the high tinker\'s special weapons.' WHERE `word_id` = 180845; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26364
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our dark rangers search the fields for worgen terrorists. These worgen have been sent out by their dark masters to hunt and kill us. And though a dark ranger is a formidable combatant, the worgen often attack in packs, which can overwhelm even a dark ranger.$B$BSearch the fields around the ruins of Southshore for Bloodfang forsaken hunters. Kill any that you see! For the Forsaken and for Lordaeron!' WHERE `word_id` = 187842; -- locales_quest - details : entry=28332
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our defense of the Barrens hasn\'t gone well under Gar\'dul\'s command, $N. Garrosh has sent Warlord Bloodhilt here to take control of the situation. He\'s here in camp, and if you want to make a good impression, you\'ll demonstrate some initiative.$B$BHead east into the Fields of Blood and seek out Northwatch recon units. Bringing the new Warlord a stack of their merit badges will help you make a name for yourself!' WHERE `word_id` = 174940; -- locales_quest - details : entry=24551
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our destinies are forever intertwined. There are events taking place that are reshaping our world and ultimately will destroy it. We must put an end to them before it is too late.$B$BKnow that you can always count on me, $G brother : sister;! We will meet again on the larger island. May you find peace until then, $N.' WHERE `word_id` = 174377; -- locales_quest - details : entry=14445
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our dragons are returning from battle covered in Twilight corrupted flame and pursued by Twilight drakes.$B$BMy menders can tend to our dragons\' wounds, but they must be defended. Keep the drakes off of my menders. Lend your healing to our dragons as well if you are able.$B$BThank you for your help with this. Our battles for Grim Batol are never-ending. We need to get our strongest dragons back into the battle as soon as possible.' WHERE `word_id` = 184728; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27505
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our duty for the day is done. It is only a matter of time before we defeat the Scourge. Today, we made progress.' WHERE `word_id` = 184572; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27467
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our duty is fulfilled. Even so, it troubles me that today\'s damsels were less than gracious... only the fair-haired one by the lake managed to show us any gratitude for our chivalry. Perhaps tomorrow\'s damsels will have thankfulness to match their beauty. Now we must ride. More adventures await!' WHERE `word_id` = 175323; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=24705
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our Earthen Ring friends here are wondering if we can lend them a hand. There are faceless down below in the Scalding Chasm that are defiling all of the wildlife.$B$BCan you take care of that for me?' WHERE `word_id` = 179779; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26070
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our efforts in containing the destruction don\'t appear to be quite enough. I fear we\'re going to need aid from beyond the waking world.$B$BTwilight cultists inside the Earthshatter Cavern to the east have opened a gateway to a nightmare-infested section of the Emerald Dream. They hold a green dragon prisoner named Thessera there.$B$BGo through the nightmare portal and free her. She will be a powerful ally.' WHERE `word_id` = 172253; -- locales_quest - details : entry=13586
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our efforts to improve relations with the red dragons has really paid off, $N.' WHERE `word_id` = 185454; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27702
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our enemies abound, $C, even here at our very doorstep. The night elves have reinforced Talrendis Point in an attempt to stop our advance into Ashenvale. As we speak, their scouts patrol the nearby hills, reporting every movement to and from these gates.$B$BWe must remove these eyes of Ashenvale.$B$BGo. Your prey stalks all around these gates, especially to the east. Slay the scouts who shadow us!' WHERE `word_id` = 173311; -- locales_quest - details : entry=14117
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our enemies are becoming smarter - adapting to our tactics. Recently an attack was made upon Pyrewood Village, southwest of here. Our troops occupying the town were decimated, of course, but what made the attack especially interesting was the racial composition of the attacking force. No humans were used.$B$B<Walden laughs.>$B$BRightfully, they fear being reanimated as Forsaken.$B$BLet us teach the non-humans a lesson in fear. Together we will show them what happens to corpses that we cannot use.' WHERE `word_id` = 184906; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27548
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our enemies are numerous, $C. It will take skill and bravery to overcome them all.' WHERE `word_id` = 188960; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28671
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our enemies be plottin\' against us in the halls of Blackrock Depths. The Twilight\'s Hammer cultists, they be busy preaching and handin\' out books to the Dark Irons, tellin\' them that it\'s time for war. Wit\' a Dark Iron army at their backs, the Twilight\'s Hammer be a formidable force. We must put an end to the agitation!$B$BI be wantin\' you to go into Domicile of Blackrock Depths and use this torch to burn those Twilight\'s Hammer books!' WHERE `word_id` = 188274; -- locales_quest - details : entry=28477
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our enemies stir once more, $N, and you will be at the forefront of battle.' WHERE `word_id` = 187727; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28304
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our engineers have been working on getting our battle machines ready for our assault on Gnomeregan, but we\'re out of pilots!$B$BWe\'ve developed a device called the Motivate-a-Tron, which prevents distraction from other sources and gives the gnome the courage to enlist.$B$BAfter motivating a few Gnome Citizens, lead them out to Captain Tread Sparknozzle out at Steelgrill\'s Depot, just south of Ironforge.$B$BOh, and be careful. The device is still a little experimental.' WHERE `word_id` = 275315; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25229
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our escape from the shell can\'t have gone unnoticed, but either the naga at these ruins weren\'t informed or they don\'t consider us a threat. I don\'t intend to take the opportunity for granted - we strike now.$B$BI need you to slip into the lower level of the ruins to our west and take out as many of their patrols as you can. We cannot risk any of those patrols finding out about our occupation of this cave - make sure none escape.' WHERE `word_id` = 177910; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25579
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our Expedition made it safely through the Portal and set up a new base called Thrallmar. Yet as you can see. the Burning Legion moved in and cut us off from our brothers. Clearly, the demons hope to retake the Dark Portal and prevent us from gathering reinforcements from Azeroth.' WHERE `word_id` = 146894; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=9407
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our expedition to this forsaken, wreck of a world has almost ground to a halt, $N. We encountered more resistance than we bargained for.$B$BAs if facing the Burning Legion again wasn\'t bad enough - there are horrors in this land unlike anything we\'ve ever encountered.' WHERE `word_id` = 149811; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10140
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our forces are falling beneath an unleashed monstrosity - Charhounds from the molten depths.$B$BThese dogs fear nothing and will not stop until their lust for blood is satisfied. Our forces are barely holding them back.$B$BGo join the defenders in the Ashen Fields or in the Molten Flow. Perhaps you can make a dent in their numbers.' WHERE `word_id` = 190698; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29304
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our forces are holding up admirably, $C.$B$BBe that as it may, there are yet wounded to attend to - many still in the field of battle.$B$BI have created a salve that should grant the wounded enough energy to return to the ramparts for treatment. Please administer it to any in need before they become lost to us.' WHERE `word_id` = 172331; -- locales_quest - details : entry=13613
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our forces are not ready to assault Astranaar just yet, $C. They know we\'re coming, though, and they\'re not content to sit and wait for us. At the base of this cliff they\'ve created a camp from which they launch bothersome attacks by the light of the moon.$B$BBefore these skirmishes bolster their confidence any further, I want you to visit them with the wrath of the Horde! Return to me when the elves have been humbled a bit.' WHERE `word_id` = 172864; -- locales_quest - details : entry=13943
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our forces in Pyrewood were recently taken by way of sneak attack. The 7th Legion managed to infiltrate the town with their scouts, ultimately decimating our troops.$B$BThe Dark Lady has tasked us with a rescue mission. We are to find survivors and get them out of Pyrewood safely. If any soldiers live they are likely worthless, but we do as the Dark Lady commands.$B$BLet\'s get this nonsense over with, $N. Pyrewood is directly southwest of the Forsaken Front.' WHERE `word_id` = 184901; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27547
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our friend Iverron has fallen to poison from the nearby webwood spiders. I can tend to him to keep his state from deteriorating, but I need someone to gather an ingredient to prepare him an antidote.$B$BAll around the ponds you should find Moonpetal Lilies. These flowers have great healing properties, and I can use them with the ingredients I already have to restore Iverron to better health.$B$BWould you gather them for me?  There should be many just in sight of here, near the water\'s edge.' WHERE `word_id` = 189098; -- locales_quest - details : entry=28724
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our friends in the Earthen Ring have been trying to open portals back to Stormwind, with no luck. But Thordun here tells me he might just have the key.$B$BThe crazed water elementals in the nearby Verrall River Delta have been sent into a frenzy. Thordun tells me we can channel their energy into a portal.$B$BI don\'t understand all this elemental-claptrap, but I understand one thing: killin\' elementals and takin\' their whirlpool cores. Deliver them to Talaa in the courtyard!' WHERE `word_id` = 184873; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27537
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our goal is to find the demon hunter, Loramus Thalipedes. Let me know when you are ready to begin the blood ritual, and then stand back.' WHERE `word_id` = 178326; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25686
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our goal is within sight, $N!$B$BWe can break the will of this demon army by bringing down the one who leads them. If we can succeed, Desolace will be ours!$B$BWhen you are ready, lead a group of centaurs through the pass to the south, into Shadowbreak Ravine. Find where Agogridon hides!$B$BI will gather the other khans and meet you there to face him in battle.' WHERE `word_id` = 174225; -- locales_quest - details : entry=14394
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our greatest warriors, and our greatest <snort> shamans would envy your will, $R.$B$BDefeat more of the Bristlebacks knowing that they cannot stop you! <snort>' WHERE `word_id` = 139698; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=5045
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our grunts are strong but have no initiative. They\'re fighting toe-to-toe on the front lines. But an independent $C like yourself - well, someone like you can slip behind the lines and cause some real havoc deep within the enemy redoubt.$B$BCut a swath of destruction through the heart of Talrendis, $N! Slay our foes in territory they think is secure, leaving blood and fear in your wake.' WHERE `word_id` = 174557; -- locales_quest - details : entry=24433
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our historical records! The thought of dark iron vermin delving into our past just made me sick to my stomach. We appreciate you bringing this back to us. We\'d like to offer you some coin as a reward.' WHERE `word_id` = 172471; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=13657
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our hunter, Kilag Gorefang, and a few scouts, traveled into the vale down the path to the west. They\'re ...searching for... \'precious cargo\'... that we were guarding when the filthy Alliance sunk our ship.$B$BThe way is blocked by deadly plants and they have not been able to break through.$B$B$N, prove your worth as a goblin and a $C. Journey into the Vicious Vale to find Kilag.' WHERE `word_id` = 173610; -- locales_quest - details : entry=14235
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our ice-cold, refreshing Silversnap Ice! I can\'t thank you enough, "dawg", for this entirely spontaneous act of heroism! Here, have your very own bottle as a totally sincere gesture of thanks! Be sure to tell ALL YOUR FRIENDS how good it is.' WHERE `word_id` = 185029; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27592
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our invasion plan looks to have backfired. Several of our birds have already reported in, speaking of fires breaking out across the vales of central Hyjal.$B$BNow, many of our druids are stranded out in the field, unprepared for such a large-scale attack. Thisalee was near Ashen Lake, and several others were out in the Regrowth, to the northeast.$B$BGo, $N! Find them, and make sure that they do not succumb to this backdraft!' WHERE `word_id` = 190398; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29197
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our lands are lost. Our children stolen in the night, forced into slavery - or worse...$B$B<Mordenai\'s voice tenses.>$B$BThe time is now, my ally. The time to retake what was once ours has come! You have proven yourself a capable combatant and compassionate soul.$B$BWill you swear to assist the Netherwing Dragonflight in retaking our lands and rebuilding our homes? Will you swear to watch over the flight and allow the bloodline to be born anew? Swear this and let us battle for our home and our loved ones!' WHERE `word_id` = 153306; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=11012
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our last hope of victory lies in defeating the val\'kyr. You\'ve done well up until now... but you\'re only one $G man: woman; and there are literally dozens of them raining destruction on the battlefield.$B$BOne enormous val\'kyr sits atop the tower to our south... you can see her from here. Perhaps if we eliminate her, the remaining val\'kyr will dissipate.$B$BThis is our only hope. Bring some of Grant\'s men with you. You\'ll need their protection for this battle.' WHERE `word_id` = 183825; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27204
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our last two negotiators haven\'t returned from speaking with the Dragonmaw Warchief. I think we might need to flex a little bit of muscle.$B$BThis time, I want YOU to accompany the negotiator. Their Warchief might think twice once he realizes the Horde is full of battle-hardened heroes like yourself.$B$BSimply escort our negotiator into the main hold in the center of Dragonmaw Port and look menacing.' WHERE `word_id` = 181458; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26549
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our law demands that those behind this attack face proper retribution.$B$BThe band of bandits\' ringleader is a man known as Warlord Ihsenn.$B$BYou will find him in the far west of the desert. Make sure his transgressions do not go unpunished.' WHERE `word_id` = 188376; -- locales_quest - details : entry=28502
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our lost allies have already made it back. They are shaken, but alive. Thank you for rescuing them.' WHERE `word_id` = 190103; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=29189
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our main base of operations in Stonetalon Mountains is Krom\'gar Fortress. It is from there that Overlord Krom\'gar oversees all Horde military activity in the region. Krom\'gar reports everything that happens directly to the Warchief.$B$BThe attack plans you brought back detail an assault that\'s supposed to take place against Krom\'gar Fortress soon. Take the plans and head to the fortress, southwest of here. Give them to the Overlord.$B$BSo long, $N. Truly, Hellscream\'s eyes are upon you.' WHERE `word_id` = 179558; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26004
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our meeting is no coincidence, $N.' WHERE `word_id` = 183541; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27113
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our militia has been nearly wiped out. Only I and these few farmers remain.$B$BThose winged creatures... they took the bodies of our men and... and turned them into walking, undead corpses!  With every one of our men they took, they bolstered their own ranks.$B$BIt pains me to admit it, but you will need to fight them too, along with the deathguards and val\'kyr. As they did in life, they hunt in packs, so take some of my minutemen with you.' WHERE `word_id` = 183819; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27202
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our new arrangement with the Horde will put my people in direct conflict with the Alliance.$B$BBring. Them. On.$B$BAs we speak, the Alliance moves up the peninsula to threaten Dragonmaw Port.$B$BFind Rok\'tar to the south - I believe he has set up a command post on one of the shipwrecks - and ensure that the Twilight Shores remain in our control.' WHERE `word_id` = 185087; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27607
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our next strike against the ogres will bring you further east to Stromgarde. The living consider these gutted ruins worth clinging to. Their sentimentality is disgusting!$B$BAll that Stromgarde holds for us is a foul den of more ogres, waiting to be struck down. Travel there and slay their shamans and lords, and ensure what passes for leadership among the ogres is snuffed out.' WHERE `word_id` = 179642; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26027
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our objective in the Twilight Highlands is to storm the Bastion of Twilight, but the Alliance have decided to make war.$B$BSo we will give them war!$B$BSlay their marines until the lesson is learned.' WHERE `word_id` = 185095; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27611
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our old enemy, Thermaplugg, is doing his best to keep us from rebuilding and finishing our reclamation of Gnomeregan. He\'s sent one of his most loyal henchmen, Razlo Crushcog, and a force of irradiated gnomes to harry us.$B$BThey\'ve taken over an old arsenal up the road to the north, and Crushcog\'s technicians are repairing those weapons. We have to stop them before they\'re able to get those mechano-tanks back online. Go to Crushcog\'s Arsenal and eliminate as many of the technicians as you can.' WHERE `word_id` = 180731; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26331
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our outpost in the southeast is having some problems. I don\'t have any details other than... well, let me just read from the latest letter:$B$B"The orcs have grown petulant. Send help or I will have them beaten with reeds."$B$BThat\'s it. It was sent from our chief psylosopher, Nils Beerot. Yea, I have no idea what that means either. Could you please head to Eastpoint Tower and find out what he needs? I can\'t take any more of these cryptic letters!$B$BJust head south and then follow the road east.' WHERE `word_id` = 188810; -- locales_quest - details : entry=28620
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our pact you did not break. The soul I did take. The reward I shall make.' WHERE `word_id` = 139891; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=5127
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our paths will cross again, $C.' WHERE `word_id` = 142734; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=8042
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our policy of conscripting non-violent criminals from the Stormwind Stockades has come back to haunt us, $N. Some of my less-scrupulous soldiers broke ranks after our victory in Taurajo and are looting the remains of the city.$B$BThis is a breakdown in discipline. Worse, the desecration of their homes only spurs the enemy to fight harder when our ultimate goal should be peace.$B$BTake these manacles and bring the Taurajo looters to justice. Speak to them first, but you may need force to subdue them.' WHERE `word_id` = 176173; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25057
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our preparations are complete. I have put the materials you gathered into this urn. Take it to the Master\'s Terrace, where the fight took place, and set it on fire.$B$BThe energy released will bring life back to the charred remains of Arcanagos. Defeat the creature and retrieve its essence immediately!  You will need to take it to Alturus.$B$BShould you fail, the stars predict you will have let a great terror loose upon the skies.$B$BA terror known as Nightbane!' WHERE `word_id` = 147823; -- locales_quest - details : entry=9644
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our race\'s gift of shamanism stirred me from a years-long lethargy. Now I provide for all here, crafting the same boons that gave me newfound strength.$B$BThe Highland raptors are cunning and fierce beasts. Their spirits can grant our warriors great strength. Bring me raptor eyes, so I may make the amulets as Tor\'gan taught me.' WHERE `word_id` = 179928; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26107
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our reinforcements from Kalimdor arrived last night. Three orc gunships full of supplies, weapons and soldiers. Three orc gunships lost to Bloodfang\'s damned worgen.$B$BHow could an entire orc fleet lose to a small band of enemy combatants that lack any siege weaponry? An important question that you will answer for me.$B$BGather your gear and report to the orc admiral, Hatchet, at the Forsaken Rear Guard, southwest of here.$B$BGet those orcs operational, $N.$B$BI await your full report.' WHERE `word_id` = 183353; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27065
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our renewed forces can handle the situation here for a while without you. I\'ve received reports that Joseph the Insane, a former Scarlet Crusade officer, is in the Scarlet Monastery Cathedral and is taking his band of renegades to strike out against Scarlet Commander Mograine.$B$BThis is an excellent opportunity. Go there and help him with his insane task, and maybe we can use the Monastery as an excellent stronghold right at Sylvanas\' doorstep!' WHERE `word_id` = 183037; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26985
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our resources are limited, $C, but that doesn\'t mean we can\'t make some trouble down below. Use the ropes here to sneak down the hillside, then slay the human prison wardens.$B$BKilling a couple scrawny guards won\'t turn the tide of battle, but  imagine the fear and chaos we\'ll reap as the humans discover the mutilated bodies...$B$B<Holgom grins a yellowed grin, his eyes glinting.>' WHERE `word_id` = 176991; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25284
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our revered lady has sent me to aid you in your task. She wants you to retrieve the stolen Crucible of Nazsharin and bring it back here as soon as you can.$B$BShe grows impatient to start the ritual of summoning so that we might fully begin our preparations for war.' WHERE `word_id` = 179014; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25862
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our sacred wells have been tainted, and I will need your help to fix this.$B$BTo cleanse each well, I must create a cleansing totem, then you must bring the totem to the well and perform a cleansing ritual.$B$BFirst we will create a cleansing totem for the Winterhoof Water Well. To do this, the land must offer its aid. Hunt prairie wolves for their paws and adult plainstriders for their talons. They are to the southwest.$B$BReturn to me with the paws and talons, $N.' WHERE `word_id` = 174535; -- locales_quest - details : entry=20440
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our scouts are bringing back reports of fire hawk hatchlings all over the peak... their eggs must have hatched very recently. Better yet, it seems that they\'re extremely docile.$B$BI know it may sound a strange and perhaps unsavory request, but if you were able to bring some of those hatchlings back to me, I might be able to train them to aid us in our war efforts.$B$BAre you willing?' WHERE `word_id` = 190640; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29288
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our scouts in the field report that High Shaman MacKilligan has moved out of Thundermar and is fighting amidst the Thundermar Ruins northwest of here, across the river.$B$BHe\'s a dangerous one, $N, responsible for the deaths of many a Dragonmaw. He WILL be destroyed, that is not the question.$B$BThe question is: will you be the one to earn the glory of the kill?' WHERE `word_id` = 189492; -- locales_quest - details : entry=28875
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our settlement on Sardor Isle was lost to the Hatecrest naga. Overwhelmed by their numbers, we fell back to the mainland. While they coveted their newly-gained sandbar, we raised New Feathermoon on the shore and amassed an even greater army.$B$BNow, the Hatecrest will be driven back into the sea. Find our Ancient of War along the shore. He will take you to the front lines, where Tambre leads the offensive.' WHERE `word_id` = 177045; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25304
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our settlement on Sardor Isle was lost to the Hatecrest naga. Overwhelmed by their numbers, we fell back to the mainland. While they coveted their newly-gained sandbar, we raised New Feathermoon on the shore and amassed an even greater army.$B$BNow, the Hatecrest will be driven back into the sea. Speak with Sentinel Ranadae to join our forces at Sardor. Slay the naga, and make sure whichever foul snake they take orders from is killed as well.' WHERE `word_id` = 177049; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25305
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our shipments of saltpeter from Dustwallow have been held up, which means we can\'t manufacture our own gunpowder here.$B$BBut I can retrofit our armaments to use goblin Blast-O powder. It\'s unstable, dangerous, toxic to the skin, and harmful if swallowed... but I think I can make it work!$B$BGet me a keg of the stuff by attacking one of those goblin sapper specialists who\'ve been storming our walls.' WHERE `word_id` = 176264; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25079
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our situation is growing a bit desperate, r.$B$BWe must focus our attention on the naga and their prisoners, but it would be folly to do so without being prepared, and down here that means finding a way to travel more quickly.$B$BThese sharks are clearly fond of sea turtle. Let\'s see if we can turn that into our advantage.' WHERE `word_id` = 177633; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25497
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our small outpost is under constant attack. Several nights ago, we were raided by the spiders of Netherweb Ridge, on the southeastern edge of the Bone Wastes. They poisoned many of our people, wrapped them in webs and carried them away. Some of our warriors took up arms and with little preparation pursued the spiders.$B$BWe have not seen the captives or our hunting parties since. We hope that some may still be alive, perhaps imprisoned by the spiders. Our numbers are few. Will you search for our people?' WHERE `word_id` = 152712; -- locales_quest - details : entry=10873
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our tanks have to pull back, and that means repairs in the field.$B$BSmash up summa them diamond-bladed shredders those wee green monsters are using to fell the trees along the coast, and bring me a heap of leftover shredder parts. We\'ll bang together sumthun\' to get our tanks movin\' again.' WHERE `word_id` = 184432; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27433
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our task is complete, and it\'s all thanks to you, $N. I\'d like to offer you your choice from our coffers. In addition, I intend to make you a full-fledged member of our order. Welcome to the Thorium Brotherhood, $N. I\'m proud to call you a brother.' WHERE `word_id` = 186770; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28064
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our task is not yet finished. There are more that must be taught a lesson!' WHERE `word_id` = 148886; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=9906
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our tasks are done here for now. This water proved to be of great importance, but it wasn\'t originally meant for me. Go ahead and bring it back to Corithras at the crossroads, I\'m sure he\'d like you to deliver it to its original destination.' WHERE `word_id` = 166711; -- locales_quest - details : entry=935
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our time here draws to a close. I must somehow follow the trail of these naga captives if we are to discover their purposes in this region.$B$BBut before I move on, I would see the destruction of this operation!$B$BNevermind their numbers, I have a plan that has the potential to even the odds.$B$BOutside this cave, famished great sharks, displaced by these naga, seek food.$B$BIn their weakened state, they will be susceptible to suggestion. Use this orb to subdue them, then direct them against our enemy.' WHERE `word_id` = 179119; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25887
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our time here draws to a close.$B$BI must find my way across the chasm and discover the purpose behind the naga activities here.$B$BIf you are to follow me, you would be wise to conclude your search for a suitable mount first.$B$BSearch the area north of here and find a puffer hatchling. Once you\'ve caught one, bring it to the trench to the west. I will prepare everything you need there.' WHERE `word_id` = 177666; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25506
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our time to act is short. Loken prepares for war.' WHERE `word_id` = 191471; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=29863
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our trade frigate\'s still all the way out there on the water, swarming with Gilblins! AHH!$B$BSorry about that. But really! We need a way to get you out there and get back our stuff. There\'s quality goods left on that ship! QUALITY! LIKE MY MIDDLE NAME!$B$BLucky for you, I have an idea! Head right outside the camp and check along the north wall... my son Jerry\'ll get you over there with our cannon! If he\'s been practicing, that is!' WHERE `word_id` = 185058; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27600
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our venerable warmatron, Okrilla, has sent me to the far reaches of the world in search of suitable heroes that would join our cause. Are you interested in strengthening the Horde\'s grasp over the Eastern Kingdoms? Then take this portal to the Blasted Lands and report to Okrilla at Dreadmaul Hold!' WHERE `word_id` = 189459; -- locales_quest - details : entry=28865
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our victories are quickly piling up, $N. The Scarlet Crusade, which has long persecuted the Forsaken, is on its last legs. While they still hold their monastery here in Tirisfal, they no longer occupy Hearthglen, or Tyr\'s Hand, far to the east.$B$BAs recently as last week, there have been reports of Scarlet Crusade activity at a small camp east of Felstone Field, but I have reason to believe that they too have been eliminated. Travel there, and verify this information for me.' WHERE `word_id` = 182817; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26930
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our village leaders have apprehended human invaders that have attempted to enter the valley. These invaders are kept in cages, in the cave to the west.$B$BI want you to burn one of these invaders, $N. Cast your newly-learned spell on the human dogs, then watch them suffer.' WHERE `word_id` = 176493; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25146
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our village leaders have apprehended human invaders that have attempted to enter the valley. These invaders are kept in cages, in the cave to the west.$B$BI want you to use this ability on one of these invaders, $N. Enchant your blade with the power of earth, then strike out at these enemies!' WHERE `word_id` = 176486; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25144
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our village leaders have apprehended human invaders that have attempted to enter the valley. These invaders are kept in cages, in the cave to the west.$B$BI want you to use your shout on one of these invaders, $N. Defeat a captured Northwatch scout while under the effects of your battle shout. Return when you are successful.' WHERE `word_id` = 176500; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25148
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our war has been waged for longer than your kind counts time. Let us see if you can make a difference, $R.$B$BThe stone troggs are a mistake of the titans. On your world they have succumbed to the Curse of Flesh. But here, in Deepholm, you see them in their true form.$B$BWe\'re surrounded. Maybe you could go out there and break a few troggs down for us. See what they\'re really made of?' WHERE `word_id` = 181272; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26500
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our warriors are doing everything they can to hold back the elementals, but their numbers are endless. We need to do something to slow down the assault.$B$BFind some suitable patches of dirt or ash out on the Ashen Fields to our north and plant these seeds. They will grow deadly vines that may slow down our enemies a bit. It\'s not much, but every bit helps.' WHERE `word_id` = 189932; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29139
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our warriors are out there fightin\' hard to kill them nasty Wildhammer dwarves, so we can be safe back here at the village. It\'s only right we do what we can to support them.$B$BA good beat\'s what every troll needs to do his best in a fight. The poundin\' rhythm of the drums drivin\' you to hit harder, callin\' the spirits to watch over you. Take my drums to the battlefield wit\' ya. Play \'em for our warriors, and let \'em show the Wildhammer who owns these lands!' WHERE `word_id` = 180374; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26240
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our work has only just begun, $N. Are you prepared for your next task?' WHERE `word_id` = 136608; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=2118
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our work here in Chiselgrip is done, mostly thanks to you. We\'ll now be moving on to the east, to Morgan\'s Vigil.$B$BOur intel indicates that Morgan\'s Vigil has been vacated, as most of its inhabitants have moved into Blackrock Mountain to fight their own battle against the Blackrocks. It should serve as a sufficient base of operations for the final stages of our plan.$B$BOf course, Keeshan will be joining you on the road. As will I.' WHERE `word_id` = 187745; -- locales_quest - details : entry=28310
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our work here in Chiselgrip is done, mostly thanks to you. We\'ll now be moving on to the northeast, to Flame Crest.$B$BFlame Crest is in the cliffs, past the Ruins of Thaurissan. It should serve as a sufficient base of operations for the final stages of our plan.$B$BOf course, my son Ariok will be joining you on the road. As will I.' WHERE `word_id` = 188218; -- locales_quest - details : entry=28442
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our work in Darkshore is not yet done. We might have stopped the landmass from shattering, but our enemies still have a strong presence in the area.$B$BI want you to contact a group of druids at the Grove of the Ancients, far to the south. They are led by an old friend of mine, Balren of the Claw.$B$BTell them that the time has come to take the battle to our foes. I will come to aid them as soon as we stabilize the area.' WHERE `word_id` = 172764; -- locales_quest - details : entry=13902
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our work is done here, $N. Against all odds, we stopped the Neferset advance on Nahom.$B$BLet us join the forces pushing west, lest they take all the glory for themselves.$B$BThey must\'ve reached the outskirts of Neferset City by now.' WHERE `word_id` = 188825; -- locales_quest - details : entry=28623
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our world is in danger, $N! We need the help of great heroes, like you, to save it!' WHERE `word_id` = 185539; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27722
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Our worst fears might soon be realized. The forces at work behind this temporal disturbance are a new flight of dragons known as the Infinite. We do not know where they came from or why they are destroying timeways.$B$BIn this pocket of time, they have kidnapped Taretha Foxton, daughter of Tammis Foxton, the secretary of Aedelas Blackmoore, ruler of Durnholde and overseer of all internment camps on Azeroth.' WHERE `word_id` = 150430; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10282
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Out here in the wilds of Outland we are weak with few heroes to defend our rights, but you have given them something to fear $C. I do not think the ethereals will soon forget the strong right arm of $N.' WHERE `word_id` = 152562; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10840
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Out here on the outskirts of town, it\'s a wonder the walking dead haven\'t eaten me!  In fact, just yesterday a pack of ghouls was pounding on the walls of my tower!$B$BI want to make an effigy - a kind of "scarecrow" for ghouls. To do that I need some ghoul ribs. You can find plenty of them on the fetid corpses wandering Manor Mistmantle\'s grounds, north of Darkshire...$B$BGet the ribs for me, and I will repay you with some coin.' WHERE `word_id` = 181950; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26677
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Out-frikkin-standing!  As of right now Private $N, you are my favorite person on the sorry remains of this sorry planet!$B$BI\'m sure that the eggheads are going to wet themselves when I hand that blood over to them for study. Who knows, maybe we\'ll find a new weapon in the fight against those damned fel orcs?' WHERE `word_id` = 147602; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=9589
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Out-frikkin-standing! As of right now, you are my eighth favorite person on the smoldering remains of this sorry planet!' WHERE `word_id` = 191109; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=29538
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Outlaws have kidnapped the sheriff!' WHERE `word_id` = 190774; -- locales_quest - details : entry=29372
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Outstanding - your tribute to the Dawn is duly noted, $N. With this accomplished, I am delighted to make our mantles available to you for purchase. So long as you maintain your current status with us, these mantles will be purchasable from any authorized quartermaster of the Argent Dawn.$B$BFor the Dawn, my $Gbrother:sister;!' WHERE `word_id` = 271375; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=5504
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Outstanding work at the gates, $N! The main body of the Alliance force is in general retreat. But I\'m not satisfied.$B$BThey sacked Taurajo, which was little more than a hunters\' camp. This \'Alliance\' is unmasked at last for what it really is: A renegade band of butchers.$B$BEven now a group of humans linger behind to pick at the bones of smouldering Taurajo.$B$B<Bloodhilt hurls an axe into the dirt.>$B$BMake them suffer.' WHERE `word_id` = 174981; -- locales_quest - details : entry=24572
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Outstanding work, $N!  I\'d have you back up in the air and bombing them again, but policy around here is to make sure that our pilots get plenty of R&R. Sorry, I don\'t make the rules, but I sure as hell enforce them!' WHERE `word_id` = 153347; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=11023
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Outstanding work, $N! I will notify Drolfy that a hero did rise to meet his challenge and that the cruel Bloodpaw is no more!' WHERE `word_id` = 159699; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=12441
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Outstanding work, $N! Now our forces only need to worry about the Horde as they enter Stonetalon.' WHERE `word_id` = 178961; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25851
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Outstanding work, $N! We can get this keep back into working order now with the return of our citizens.' WHERE `word_id` = 159131; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=12237
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Outstanding work, $N.$B$BWithout having done so, the surviving berserkers would surely have swarmed you during your fight with the king.' WHERE `word_id` = 163193; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=13241
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Outstanding work, soldier! Simply amazing! Oh I\'ll get the medal of bravery for this, er, I mean you\'ll be rewarded handsomely for this!' WHERE `word_id` = 138516; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=3825
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Outstanding work, soldier. The frequency of the attacks is sure to lessen - at least until they bring forth more dreadlords.$B$BNow for the bad news: I\'ve got your new orders...' WHERE `word_id` = 149742; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10123
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Outstanding work, soldier. The frequency of the attacks is sure to lessen - at least until they bring forth new dreadlords.$B$BNow for the bad news: I\'ve got your new orders...' WHERE `word_id` = 149820; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=10142
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Outstanding!  My name is Belnistrasz, and I thank you for rescuing me. I had given myself up for dead... or worse, as a meal for these Scourge-infested vermin.$B$BListen... rather than just flee, I want to make a difference for all of our sakes. Would you be up to helping me out to that end?  It\'s probably dangerous, but somebody needs to do it and I seriously doubt other adventurers will wander into this desolate place.' WHERE `word_id` = 183174; -- locales_quest - details : entry=27019
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Outstanding!  Those sandy carp are picky eaters aren\'t they?' WHERE `word_id` = 181493; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=26557
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Outstanding! But, there\'s much to be done before the Scourge menace is completely driven from mighty Quel\'Thalas!$B$BHere, take this coin... it\'s not much, but you\'ve earned it.' WHERE `word_id` = 146281; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=9138
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Outstanding! Don\'t wander off too far, kid. We might need you to take on another task or two.' WHERE `word_id` = 143263; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=8310
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Outstanding! Let\'s see if this does the trick.... Stand back, $N!' WHERE `word_id` = 178008; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=25602
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Outstanding! Nothing can stop us from being the greatest purveyors of ice cream in all of Azeroth!' WHERE `word_id` = 186709; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28048
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Outstanding! Now just a little modification here, and a tweak there....' WHERE `word_id` = 157423; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=11699
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Outstanding! Now where did I put that 500 pound chicken and Volume II of "Draconic For Dummies???" Oh, and here\'s a little something for all your hard work!' WHERE `word_id` = 143918; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=8578
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Outstanding! Those overgrown apes will soon know what it means to mess with the Alliance!' WHERE `word_id` = 156568; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=11426
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Outstanding!$B$BNuthin\' better with a pint than a hot morsel of meat.' WHERE `word_id` = 158587; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=12113
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Outstanding!$B$BOur stores are nearly replenished now. You\'ve done your part, $N.' WHERE `word_id` = 159032; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=12216
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Outstanding!$B$BThis could be the turn of luck we\'ve all been hoping for.' WHERE `word_id` = 191370; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=29763
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Outstanding!$B$BThis could be the turn of luck we\'ve all been hoping for.$B$BWell done, $N!' WHERE `word_id` = 155231; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=11252
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Outstanding, $N!  This was no small feat bringing these to me. No doubt you\'ve acted as our tribe\'s confessor today in preserving ourselves against the threat of Hakkar. These wraps are befitting a friend of the tribe such as you!' WHERE `word_id` = 142799; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=8061
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Outstanding, $N! Years of intelligence, lost! The Scarlet Crusade will surely feel this blow in the coming weeks.' WHERE `word_id` = 139408; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=4771
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Outstanding, soldier! The orcs and ogres will be reeling from this blow for minutes, maybe even hours!' WHERE `word_id` = 138506; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=3823
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Over half our team is dead or missing, junior. This is our last stand up here on the high bluffs. Those damned iron dwarves pushed us out of both Ivald\'s Ruin and Baelgun\'s. Now I\'ve got a plan to get us back inside before they bury up all our goodies and we lose that data forever.' WHERE `word_id` = 156704; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=11474
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Overload Archmage Ataeric with arcane power to bring down the Transdimensional Shield.' WHERE `word_id` = 184791; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=27518
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Overload the Defective Generator' WHERE `word_id` = 173347; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=14125
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Overload the Defective Generator, Activate the Leaky Stove, Drop a Cigar on the Flammable Bed, and use the Gasbot to set KTC Headquarters ablaze!' WHERE `word_id` = 173345; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=14125
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Overloaded Harvest Golem enabled' WHERE `word_id` = 180442; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=26257
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Overlord Drakuru Defeated' WHERE `word_id` = 160932; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=12713
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Overlord Drakuru\'s task complete' WHERE `word_id` = 160675; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=12661
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Overlord Krom\'gar sends word from the base. You are to get back on the Krom\'gar hot air balloon and take it to Cliffwalker Post. From there, the plan is to unleash the payload on the Alliance at Battlescar Valley.$B$BYou better get going, $N. It\'s not wise to keep Krom\'gar waiting.$B$BSpeak to General Grebo when you arrive at your destination. He\'ll be able to brief you on the next course of action.' WHERE `word_id` = 179808; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26077
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Overlord Ramtusk and the Death\'s Head mobilize for war. It took many scouts\' lives, but we have learned of the weapon they intend to use to overtake the rest of the Barrens.$B$BIt is known as Agathelos the Raging, an immense boar outfitted with heavy armor and force-fed the rage-inducing Kraul bat guano.$B$B$R, you must stop them before they take innocent lives!' WHERE `word_id` = 182730; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26907
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Overseer Faedris Killed' WHERE `word_id` = 163519; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=13319
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Overseer Gorthak wants you to bring him the Kaldorei Assassin\'s Head.' WHERE `word_id` = 172636; -- locales_quest - objectives : entry=13871
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Overseer Jhaeqon Killed' WHERE `word_id` = 163520; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText2 : entry=13319
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Overseer Maltorius is in charge here, but he\'s not the only dwarf of power within the Slag Pit. Lathoric the Black and his horrifying golem, Obsidion, loom just down this corridor.$B$BInterfering with Lathoric\'s altar should summon both of them. Find it, then summon Lathoric and kill him. Report to Evonice Sootsmoker when you\'re finished.' WHERE `word_id` = 186741; -- locales_quest - details : entry=28056
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Overseer Savryn Killed' WHERE `word_id` = 163522; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText4 : entry=13319
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Overstuffed Golem corpse burned' WHERE `word_id` = 184839; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=27528
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Ow! That looked painful. It was a pretty grand entrance though, lad!$B$BWelcome to Frosthold! Are ya here to help us find a path into Icecrown?' WHERE `word_id` = 161558; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=12862
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Owlbeasts... Soulless, feathered monstrosities sent from the darkest depths of the Twisting Nether to prey upon the weak.$B$B<Nils points to the woods surrounding Eastpoint Tower.>$B$BThey surround us on all sides and they are planning an attack - I can sense it. You must stop them before they can organize.$B$BI want you to head into the forest and kill every owlbeast that you see. NONE SHOULD SURVIVE!' WHERE `word_id` = 188868; -- locales_quest - details : entry=28634
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Oy, mon! Ya did it! We soon be havin\' fish to eat, thanks be to you.' WHERE `word_id` = 174010; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=14334
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Pack up your gear, $N, it\'s time to join up with the rest of the Northwatch forces in Southern Barrens. Your first mission in Southern Barrens should be fairly straightforward.$B$BTwo days ago we received a distress signal from Commander Walpole. He and his battalion are pinned down in Stonetalon Pass, just outside of Honor\'s Stand. They\'ve got Horde all over the place! Get there and help him out. I\'ll forward news of our alliance with the Grimtotem to Northwatch command.' WHERE `word_id` = 178963; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25852
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Pah! Crude and clumsy is all I see!$B$BYou need more than just strength. My axes are just as strong as Lilith\'s maces, but so sharp, I can cut through a tree in one chop!$B$BYou heard me, one chop! I\'ll prove it, too, here in front of everyone. Go ask Deez if he can get a tree in here!' WHERE `word_id` = 188828; -- locales_quest - details : entry=28624
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Pairs of Blackrock Boots polished' WHERE `word_id` = 187493; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=28245
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Pale Resonating Crystal struck' WHERE `word_id` = 181881; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=26659
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Paltrow, establish a foothold in Windshear Valley. A strong ground assault is vital to our campaign! When we make our assault against Krom\'gar, your men will provide the chaos and confusion that the gnome flying machines will need to get close enough to bomb the orc fortress.$B$BThe flying machines will detonate the Krom\'gar bomb while it\'s sitting in their base, taking out the entire fortress in the process.$B$BBurn after reading.$B$B-Force Commander Valen$B$BNorthwatch Expedition Base Camp' WHERE `word_id` = 179598; -- locales_quest - details : entry=26016
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Panicking Worker slapped' WHERE `word_id` = 187862; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=28336
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Parchment Created' WHERE `word_id` = 142232; -- locales_quest - ObjectiveText1 : entry=7629
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Pardon me, young $R.$B$BI\'m in need of a little help. I\'ve just finished filling an order for harnesses that must be delivered right away.$B$BI\'m a bit old for the trip, especially considering how dangerous things have become lately.$B$BWould you mind?$B$BThey need to go to Smeed, a goblin who lives just southeast of here.' WHERE `word_id` = 174038; -- locales_quest - details : entry=14341
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Pardon my saying so, but I am surprised you completed the task set out before you alive. Those monsters were responsible for the deaths of countless thousands, a great many of them heroes still spoken highly of to this day. You have earned my respect and a reward for your courage.' WHERE `word_id` = 184459; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27440
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Part of this machine is still moving, but on closer inspection it\'s been severely manhandled. The metal is dented and cracked, and there\'s huge footprints in the snow all around it.$B$BIn fact, it sounds like something\'s approaching right now...' WHERE `word_id` = 188852; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=28630
