UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Resourceful for a human, Gregor is. He\'s been dealing with the Steamwheedle Cartel for some time now, and has become an expert on the "art" of goblin negotiations. Though it\'s true that the goblins\' primary loyalties lie with those who have the largest coin purses, they also know and respect the value of diplomacy. If anything, it provides them with repeat customers...$B$BAt any rate, the Argent Dawn acknowledges you for your effort. Please have this, with our thanks.' WHERE `word_id` = 140891; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=6029
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Respect the lion, $N! A ferocious killer. You gotta admire the elegance of the beast... Muscle and claws... Running down its food... So primal...$B$BI\'m sorry, my mind wandered. As I was saying, I respect these lions, but they\'re just murder on our patrols. I mean that literally. The men are afraid to go to the bathroom alone at night. Can you help make our camp a little safer?$B$BBarrens lions like to linger under trees.' WHERE `word_id` = 176113; -- locales_quest - details : entry=25041
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Rest and relaxation for the tired and cold -- that\'s our motto! Please, take a seat by the fire and rest your weary bones.$B$BWould you like to try a sampling of some of our fine food and drink?' WHERE `word_id` = 136623; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=2158
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Rest in peace friends!  Do not worry -- I will tell everyone that we never gave up!' WHERE `word_id` = 158784; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=12159
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Rest in peace, my friends. I felt the anguish of the Dor\'danil Barrows lessen, and knew that you had completed your task. It was grim work that you did, $N, for the spirits you destroyed were merely victims of the Horde\'s evil. But with their destruction, let us hope the maddened spirits will finally find peace.' WHERE `word_id` = 181189; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=26472
