UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Th... Af... After we lost Gilneas City, the port fell. HU... HUM... HUMANS ARE HERE! Reinforcements from Stormwind! They slaughtered my men. Left me alive to witness their strength. To tell high command... To tell them that the 7th Legion are here...' WHERE `word_id` = 184186; -- locales_quest - offerrewardtext : entry=27350
UPDATE `trans_words` SET `content_loc7`='Tha Darkspear tribe have long been victims. Outcasts. We found ourselves fleein\' our homes time \'n time again... but dis time, it\'s not fleein\' dat drives us here.$B$BVol\'jin has offered us leadership through wisdom, and it has kept us alive dis long. Now dat same wisdom offers portents of a chaotic future for tha Horde unda Garrosh Hellscream.$B$BNo, dis time we not fleein\'. Dis time, we are fightin\' for a home dat will last.$B$BIt\'s time to begin ya trainin\', $N. Speak with Legati to the east.' WHERE `word_id` = 175450; -- locales_quest - details : entry=24770
